\id 2SA  
\h 2 Samuel 
\toc1 Samuel Nina 
\toc2 2 Samuel 
\toc3 2 Samuel 
\mt1 SAMUEL  
\mt2 LEKHABU NINA  
\mt3 Samuel Lekhabu Nina Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip David chu athil kilhen dihlou jeh in gimna achunga ana lhungin, hitobanga ka chonna chunga jong Pathen'in ichan'a eingailut hitam? atin ahi. Alangkhat a David chu Israel te leng ahina leh Pathen toh kiguijopna neija houpa ahi, ti akihedoh in ahi. Hijeh chun David dinga kinepna aum nahlai bangin, eiho jouse dingin jong kinepna aumin ahi!  
\is1 Lekhabu Jihpa Chule Ajih Kum  
\ip Samuel lekhabu nina hi, koipen in ana jih ham ti kichentah in akisei theipoi. Hinlah lekhabu kijih dungjuijin Samuel, Nathan ahilouleh Gad jih hidin ginchat ahi (1Chro. 29:29 ven). Chule hiche lekhabu hi Solomon thinung leh lenggam kihop khen jou—925 BC a kijih ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Kijihlona  
\ip Hiche lekhabu hin Israel te thusim Saul thia pat David leng vaipoh kichai chan akiseijin, hichu 1010-970 BC sung ahi. Chule alhangpin kitahna le thungai louna jeh a thilsoh thudol akimun ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Saul Thi David In Ahetdoh  
\p
\v 1 Saul thi jouvin ahitin ahi, David chun Amalek mite chunga galjona anei jouvin ahung kinunglen Ziklag munnah nini sung aumden in ahi.  
\v 2 Anithum nin mikhat Saul ngahmun a kon'in von tel dehduh le aluchunga leiset nat pum in lunghem vetsahnan ahungin, David angsung'ah jana neitah in abohkhup tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin David in adongin, “Hoiya kon hung nahim”? atileh amapan adonbut in,  
\p “Israel te ngahmun a kon hung jamdoh kahi” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Chuin David in adongin, “Ipiti hitam?” “Gal umchan thu nei seipeh in” ati.  
\p Chuin aman adonbut in, “ Sepai jouse galmun akon ajam gam uvin, mitampin thina atoh un, chule Saul le achapa Jonathan jong athi lhon tai,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Chuin David in gollhangpa ja ah, “Saul le Jonathan athi tai ti iti nahet ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Chuin mipan adonbut in, “Keima Gilboa Mol chungah kaga umkhan ahileh, hi ah chun Saul in a tengcha chu anaop phan chuleh agal mite sakol kangtalai ho leh sakol them hon ahin delphah kon chau chu ahitai. \x + \xo 1:6 \xt 1 Samuel 31:1-6; 1 Thusimbu 10:1-6\x*   
\p
\v 7 Chuin ama ahung kiheiyin keima eimu phat in ama kom adin eikoutai. Chuin keiman kadongin, iti kaki thopi ding ham kati e.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun aman eidonbut in, 'Nang koi nahim eiti?'  
\p Chuin keiman kaseipih in, 'Keima Amalek mi kahi kahi,' kati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun ama 'Kaheng'ah ataovin, hungin lang neihung that tan, ajeh chu keiman kanatna hi kathoh jou tapon hijeh chun kathi nomtai,' ati.   
\p
\v 10 “Hijeh chun “Keiman ama chu kathat tai,” tin Amalek mipa chun David kom'ah aseitai. “Ajeh chu keiman kahet ahitai ama ahinjou tah louding chu. Hiti chun a Lallukhuh leh abanbul tomna ho kahin lan nakom'ah kahin lhut e, ka pakai,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hitobang thusoh chu David leh amiten ajah doh phat un apon u abot eh un alung genthei lheh tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Hiti chun ama hon sun nilhum in Saul chule achapa Jonathan ding, Pakai sepai ho leh Israel nam mite adin an angol'un, akap un, pul adou un alunghem un ahi, ajeh chu hiche nikho a hi amaho chemjam a thisoh ahiuve.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun David in thu hinpo gollhang pa kom'ah chun aseitan, “Hoiya kon hung nahim?” ati.  
\p Chuin aman adonbut in, “Keima gamdang, jatdang Amalek mi, nagam uva khosa kahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin David in adongin, “Ipi tidan a nangman Pakai thaonu mikhat chu tha ding kichatna nanei louhel ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Chuin David in amiho khat pen kom'ah chun asei in, “That in!” ati. Hichun mipan Amalek mipa chu achemjam in adot in athat tan ahi.  
\v 16 Chujouvin David in aseijin, “Nang le nang themmo kichan nahi, ajeh chu nangman nakam tah a Pakai thaonu pa chu kathat tai,” nati.   
\s1 Saul Le Jonathan Dia David Labol  
\p
\v 17 Hiti chun David in Saul le Jonathan din kala asemin,  
\v 18 chuleh hiche hi Judah te jong hil ding ahi tin thupeh aneijin ahi. Hiche la hi thalpi la tin akihen chuleh hiche hi \it Jashar Lekhabu.\it*a kijih lut ahi. \x + \xo 1:18 \xt Joshua 10:13\x*   
\b  
\q1
\v 19 Vo Israel, naloupi nau le nakipa nau chu molsang chungah athi tai!  
\q2 Oh, i-atileh gal-hang mihat ho chu lhugam uhitam!   
\q1
\v 20 Gath mun'a thusoh hi seidoh hih un,  
\q2 Ashkelon lamlen dungah jong phongdoh hih un,  
\q1 achuti louva ahileh Philistine chanute kipah untin  
\q2 chule cheptanlou ho jong galjou banga nui diu ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 21 O Gilboa molsang ho,  
\q2 na chungah daitwi lhah dahen ahilouleh go jong juhda hen,  
\q2 chule loujaova lou hon jong amuchiga hin sepdoh dauhen.  
\q1 Ajeh chu mihatpa lumdal chu suhboh in aum tan;  
\q2 Saul lumdal chu thaotwi nulouva um ahitai.   
\p
\v 22 Jonathan thalpi chu nasatah ahin,  
\q2 chule Saul chemjam chun na loupitah atongdoh in ahi.  
\q1 Ama hon agal miteu thisan aso uvin  
\q2 chule gal-hat mi hangsan ho tahsa asunin ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 23 Saul le Jonathan chu iti ngailut le lungset um hitam!  
\q2 Ahinlai sung lhon leh athigei lhon'in aumkhom jing lhon'in ahi.  
\q1 Amani hi Muvanlai sanga gangjo leh keipi bahkai sanga jong hatjo ahi lhon'in ahi.   
\q1
\v 24 Vo Israel chanu te, Saul a dingin kap un,  
\q1 ajeh chu ama hi ponsanthip deium man tamtah a nachun pau le  
\q2 sana a najem pau chu ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 25 Oh, iti gal-hat miho galmun'a lhugam'u hitam!  
\q2 Munsang chungah Jonathan jong athisan akijam tai.   
\q1
\v 26 Jonathan kasopipa, nangjeh in ka kap-kap jeng e!  
\q2 Oh, ichan a kangailut nahi hitam!  
\q1 Chule nangman nei ngailutna hi athuh lheh in,  
\q2 numei ngailutna sangin athuh jon ahi!   
\b  
\q1
\v 27 Oh, iti mihat ho lhugam a!  
\q2 Gal manchah ho mangsoh a, amaho athia kijam chap jeng hitam?   
\c 2  
\s1 Judah Te Leng Dinga David Thao Akinu  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou chun David in Pakai chu adongin, “Judah ho khopi khat pen-pen a khu ka nungche ding ham?” atin ahileh,  
\p Pakaijin ahin donbut in, “Henge,” ati.  
\p Hijou chun David in adong paijin, “Hoiche pen khopia kache ding ham?” atin ahileh,  
\p Pakaijin adonbut in, “Hebron khopi ah,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 David jiteni chu Ahinoam kiti Jezreel mi le Carmel kho a Nabal kiti meithaipa jinu Abigail ahilhon'e. Hiti chun David le ajiteu \x + \xo 2:2 \xt 1 Samuel 25:42,43\x*  
\v 3 chuleh ama mite ho jouse leh a insung mite jouse chutoh Judah gam lam'ah akitol uvin, Hebron khopi kom'a chun acheng tauvin ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche jou chun Judah gam'a mikhat David kom'a ahungin, amapa chun David chu Judah mite jouse chunga leng din thao ahungnui.  
\p Hiti chun Saul vuija pang ho chu Jabesh – gilead mite ahiuve ti David in ajah doh phat chun, \x + \xo 2:4 \xt 1 Samuel 31:11-13\x*  
\v 5 aman hiche thuthot hi anei tauvin ahi: “Nangho Pakaijin phatthei naboh uhen ajeh chu nang hon na pakai pau Saul chunga na kitahnau na vetsah un chule phatah in na-na vuijun ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun Pakaijin ami ngailutna longlou chun na umpiu henlang chule kitahna neitah in nabol uhen! Chugoh hilouvin keima jengin jong na thilpha bolna chung uva kipaman kapeh ding nahiuve, ati.  
\v 7 Tun Saul athi tan, hijeh chun keima leng thah din Judah miten thao einu tauvin ahi, hijeh a chu keiman katep nahiuve Judah mite bangin keima din hangsan tah le kitah tah in pang uvin.”   
\s1 Ishbosheth Israel Leng Dia Akiphondoh  
\p
\v 8 Ahin Ner chapa Abner, Saul sepai jalamkaipa chu Saul chapa Ishbosheth chutoh Mahanaim lam ah achilhon tan ahi.  
\v 9 Chua chun Ishbosheth chu Gilead, Jezreel, Ephraim, Benjamin, Ashur mite gamsung leh Israel pumpi jouse chunga Leng din akiphong doh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Saul chapa Ishbosheth chu Israel te chunga leng ahi chun kum somli alhing tan, chule Mahanaim akon kumni lengvai ahinpo panin ahi. Alangkhat a Judah mite vang chu David a din kitah tah in aum jing jengun ahi.  
\v 11 David in Hebron chu munpi in asemin, chule Judah mite chungah kum sagi le lhagup sung lengvai anapon ahi.   
\s1 Israel Le Judah Kah a Kitomona  
\p
\v 12 Nikhat Abner in Ishbosheth sepai ho chu Mahanaim akon Gibeon lam apuijin ahi.  
\v 13 Hiche phat chat chun, Zeruiah chapa Joab in David sepai ho chun apuidoh in Gibeon twikul ah agakimupi uvin ahi. Chule hiche mun ah chun alang langa atouvun akigal vetto uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin Abner in Joab jah ah aseijin, “Isepai teu themkhat imasang lhon'ah kidelsah hite,”  
\p atin ahileh, “Joab jong anom tan ahi.”  
\v 15 Hichun alang toa mi som le ni cheh kidel din alhengdoh tauvin ahi – Saul chapa Ishbosheth langa din Benjamin mi som le ni, chule David langa din mi som le ni ma alhengdoh un ahi.  
\v 16 Mikhat cheh in akitopi hou sam atuh un chule achemjam un khat cheh pongpeh akisutpehto un ahileh abonchauvin athi tauvin ahi. Hijeh chun Gibeon mun hi a itih in chemjam a kidotna mun, tin akihe jing tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiche jou chun anikho maman nasatah in akisatto uvin chule David sepai te chun Abner le Israel mite chu gal in anajou uvin ahi.   
\s1 Asahel Thi  
\p
\v 18 Chule hiche nikho chun David sepai te lah a Zeruiah chapa te thum Joab, Abishai, chule Asahel apang uvin ahi. Chule Asahel hi gam sakhinou banga jang tah a lhai thei mi ahi.  
\v 19 Chuin Asahel in Abner nung chu junjel'in mundang ima velouvin chule thil imacha jeh a kingapa louvin adel tan ahi.  
\v 20 Hichun Abner akinunghei in ahileh amapa ahung chu amutan ahi, chuin aman akou in, “Nangma Asahel nahi ham?” ati.  
\p Chuin aman adonbut in, “eHnge keima kahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin Abner in agih in, “Chen lang michom khat gakidelpin! Chule chapang khangdong jep khat chu man inlang amanchah lahpeh in” ati. Hinlah Asahel chun Abner lam chu jangkei in mun danga kiheidoh louvin ajuipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Abner chun Asahel chu ahinsam kit in, “Hiche mun a kon kihei mangin! Keiman nangma katha nompoi. Akhuti leh iti na sopipa Joab mai kamu kit ding ham”? Ati.   
\p
\v 23 Ahin Asahel chu ama a kon kiheimang ding anom dehpon, hijeh chun Abner in Asahel oipoh laitah atengcha bul geijin asun lhum'in ahileh atengcha chu anung langah apaidoh leuvin hichun amun maman alhun athiden tan ahi. Chule koi hileh hilai mun hinpha a Asahel thi muchan chu akinga un ading den tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chuin Joab le Abishai in itabong thilsoh ham ti ahetdoh lhon phat in, Abner nung adel pai lhon tan, ahin Gibeon gamthip jotna lampi, Giah kom Ammah molsang agei lhon'in nisan alhum den lhon tan ahi.  
\v 25 Benjamin phungmi Abner sepai ho chu akithah gopkhom kit un molsang chungah chun apang tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Chuin Abner in Joab chu ahin sam in, “Eiho khat le khat ikitha to jing diu hitam? Achaina lung jinna jeng ahi hi n ageldoh loulai uham? Itih tah leh namiteu chu nasopi Israel te nung ahindel nauva kon nakham gah dingu hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Chuin Joab in ahinsei in, “Pathen bouvin ahei ipiti ding ham nangman ima nahin seilou hileh, ajeh chu keima hon jan khovah hella kahin del thei u nahi.”  
\v 28 Hichun Joab in saki chu amut gingin ahileh amite jouse chu ading den un Israel sepai te chu adel tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Chuche jan chun Abner le amite chun Jordan phaicham chu ajot peh un, Jordan vadung chu agalkai un chule jingkah geijin achejom jingun Mahanaim alhun kahseuvin kinga louvin ana chejom jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Hitobang tah chun, Joab le amite jong inlam akile tauvin ahi. Chule Joab in amite athiho chu ahin simtan ahileh mi 19 le Asahel alhahsam chu ahin mudoh tan ahi.  
\v 31 Ahinlah Abner mi kithat jat chu 360 ahi, chule amaho chu abon uva Benjamin phunga kon ngen ahiuve.  
\v 32 Chuin Joab le amite chun Asahel long chu Bethlehem lamah apuvin apa lhankhuh ma achun avui tauvin ahi. Chujouvin amaho jankhovah keiyin akitolun jingkho ahungvah in Hebron alhung tauvin ahi.   
\c 3  
\p
\v 1 Hichu Saul dia kitah tah a pang ho leh David dia kitah tah a pang ho kikah a sotpi kidouna anaum akipatna ahi. Hiti chun phat ahungchal chal'in David chu ahung hat cheh-cheh in, ahin Saul thaneina vang chu ahung kemsuh cheh-cheh tan ahi.   
\s1 Hebron’a David Chapate Hungpen  
\p
\v 2 Hichun David in Hebron khopi ah chapa phabep ahingin ahi:  
\b  
\li1 Apeng masapenpa chu Amnon ahin, ama hi Jezreel mi ahinoam in ahinpeh ahi.   
\li1
\v 3 Ani channa chu Daniel ahin, ama hi Carmel khoa Nabal inneipi meithainu toh ahin lhon ahi.  
\li1 Athum channa chu Absalom ahin, Geshur lengpa, Talmai chanu Maacah in ahinpeh ahi.   
\li1
\v 4 Ali channa chu Adonijah ahin, anu min chu Haggith ahi.  
\li1 Anga channa chu Shephatiah ahin, anu min chu Abital ahi.   
\li1
\v 5 Chule agup channa chu Ithream ahin, David jinu Eglah hin ahi.  
\b  
\m Chapa hichengse hi David in Hebron munna ahin ho chu ahi.   
\s1 Abner In David Sepai te Ajop  
\p
\v 6 David insung le Saul insung mite kah a kidouna aum jing lai chun, Abner chu Saul insung mite a din lamkai thahat tah ahung hitan ahi.  
\v 7 Nikhat chu Saul chapa Ishbosheth chun Abner chu apa thaikemnu Rizpah kiti Aiah chanu toh chun lumkhom danin angoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Abner chu alungsou lheh jengin, “Keima hi Judah te uicha banga hitia pehle-le ding kahim?” tin apeng jah jeng tan ahi. “Keiman ijakai napa Saul, a insung mite chule aloi le gol ho dia kaboldoh jouva nangho jeng jong David khut a kapehdoh lou nahiuvin, nangman hiche numeinu chung changa kathemmona ding nahol, hiche hi ham kachan ding chu? ati.  
\v 9 Pakaijin athu teppeh chu David in amolso jouna dia keiman imacha a kakithopi lou pou-pou leh Pathen'in keima eibolgim henlang eithat jeng hen! \x + \xo 3:9 \xt 1 Samuel 15:28\x*  
\v 10 Keima kache ding Saul lenggam chu kalah a David khut a kapeh ding ahi. chule keiman David laltouna Israel le Judah mite chunga katundoh ding hichu sahlam Dan apat lhanglam Beersheba gei hi ding ahi.  
\v 11 Hichun Ishbosheth jong chun thudang aseibe tapon ahi ajeh chu Abner in ipi ahinbol ding chu akichat ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Chuin Abner injong sottolle ho chu David kom'a asolin hitin aseisah tai, “Gamsung pumpi hi nanga hilou ham? Hijeh chun keima toh kitepna sem in, chuti leh keiman Israel mipi jouse hi nangma toh apankhomna thei diuva kahin kithopi ding nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Chuin David in adonbut in, “Aphai,” ahin kajinu Michal, Saul chanu chu nahung teng nahin lepui louleh nangma toh kihoulimna kaneilou ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun David in hiche thu hi Saul chapa Ishbosheth chu athot tan ahi: “Kajinu Michal chu neihin lepeh in, ajeh chu keiman ama hi Philistine mi 100 hinkho toh kahin kipuitha ahi.” tin aseitai. \x + \xo 3:14 \xt 1 Samuel 18:27\x*   
\p
\v 15 Hijeh chun Ishbosheth in jong Michal chu ajipa Palti, Liash chapa akon chun aga puidoh tan ahi.  
\v 16 Hiti chun Palti'n jong amanu nung chu Bahurim lam chan kap pum-pum in ahin juipeh in, hichun Abner in ajah ah, “Inlam'a kinung letan!” ati. Chuin Palti jong inlam'a akinung letan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiti chun Abner in Israel upaho chu akihoulim pin, hitin aseipeh tai, “nang hon phat khat laiya David chu na leng diuva na-na dei u hilou ham?”  
\v 18 Hijeh chun tuhi aphat ahitai! Ajeh chu Pakaijin hitin aseiye, “Keiman David hi kami Israel te Philistine te khut leh agal miteu dang jousea kon huhdoh dia kalhen ahitai,” ati.  
\v 19 Chuin Abner in Benjamin mite kom'a jong agasei kit in, chujouvin Israel mite jouse le Benjamin miten jong David kithopi ding anopna thu u gasei din Hebron lam jonin ache tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin Abner le amite mi somni Hebron alhun uchun, David in golvah loupi tah abolpin ahi.  
\v 21 Chujouvin Abner in David kom'a chun aseijin, “Keima che'ng ting kapu lengpa tosot din Israel mipi jouse gakhom ingting chule amaho leng nahi theina din ama hon nangma toh kitepna khat sem untin chule nangman amaho jouse chungah nangma lungdei bang tah in vaihom tan,” ati. Hiti chun David in Abner chu asol tan ahile amapa jong lungmong tah in achetan ahi.   
\s1 Joab In Abner Atha  
\p
\v 22 Ahinlah David in Abner lungmong tah a asoldoh jou chet chun, Joab le David sepai themkhat ho chu michom a ache nauva kon thil tampi toh ahung kile tha tauvin ahi.  
\v 23 Chuin Joab ahung lhun-lhun chun, mihon aseipeh un Abner chun injo chet chun lengpa ahung vilin chule ama lungmong tah in akisoldoh tai atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chujouvin Joab jong lengpa kom alhaijelin ngehna aganei tan, “Nangman ipi nabol hitam? Ipi nabolna a nangman Abner chu lungmong tah a na soldoh jeng hitam?  
\v 25 Nangman kichenin nahenai ama chu nangma umchan kholtoh ding le na thilbol jouse kholtoh dinga hung ahi chu!” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Chujouvin Joab in David chu adalhan asottolle ho chun Abner agamat uva ahin lepui diuvin asol tan ahi. Chuin ama hon Abner chu Sirah twikul akon ahin lepuiyun, ahin David in thil umchan imacha ahepoi.  
\v 27 Chuin Abner Hebron ahung le lhun tan, hichun Joab in ama chu kelkot phung lamah achanga kihoulimpi ding bangin apuidoh tan ahi. Hinlah Abner chun asopipa Asahel phulah nan a oipoh laitah chu asutpeh in athat tan ahi.  
\v 28 Hitobang thilsoh David in ajahdoh phat chun, hitin thuphon aneitai, “Pakai minna kakitep ahi Ner chapa Abner chung chang thua hi keima le kalenggam itih a mona neilou kahiuve, ati.  
\v 29 Joab le a insung mite jouse themmo changah ahitai. Chule Joab insung mite akon hitobang gaosapna, thisan a long damlouna, tiphah, tenggol kiphu a lamjotna, chemjam a thina chule anneh lhahsamna ho hi akhang-akhang uvin um jing hen.   
\p
\v 30 Hiti chun Joab le asopipa Abishai in Abner chu athat lhon tan ahi ajeh chu Abner in Gibeon galmun'a asopipa lhon Asahel atha jeh ahi.   
\s1 Abner Thi David Lunghem  
\p
\v 31 Chuin David in Joab le aum khompi ho cheng kom achun hitin aseiye, “Napon jouseu bot eh unlang khaodip pon jeng kivon un chule Abner adin lunghem'un,” ati. Chuin leng David ama tah in jong avuina lam a che miho nung chu ajuitan ahi.  
\v 32 Hiti chun Abner chu Hebron munna avui tauvin, chule lengpa le mipi jouse chu Abner lhan chungah chun akap tauvin ahi.  
\v 33 Chuin lengpan Abner dingin hiche thivuina la hi asai:  
\b  
\q1 “Abner chu mingol thi a thi ding hitam?   
\q1
\v 34 Nakhut teni lah akikan pon;  
\q2 nakeng teni lah akisom poi.  
\q1 Migilouho kitha bangin nangma na kithat tai,”  
\b  
\p atin ahileh, mipi jouse chu Abner adin akapkit uvin ahi.  
\v 35 Hiche Abner thi nikho chun neh ding jouse David ada tan hinlah mipi jouse chu ataovun neteijin, atiuve. Hinlah David in kitepna asemin, hitin aseiye, “Keiman nilhum masanga ipi hijongleh kaneh pou-pou leh Pathen’in eisugim henlang tha jong ithat jeng hen, ati.   
\p
\v 36 Hichun mipi ho chu alunglhai sah lheh tauvin ahi. Chule ahimongin, lengpa thilbol jouse chun amaho alunglhai sah un ahi.  
\v 37 Hiti chun Abner kithana chung changa David in pan alahlou dan Judah a um mijouse le Israel mite jousen ahethem tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 38 Chuin leng David in a sepai lamkai ho kom'a chun aseijin, “Tunia Israel sunga lamkai jaumtah khat alhuh hi geldoh lou nahiu ham?  
\v 39 Chule keima hi leng dia thao kinusa hijeng jong leng, Zeruiah chapa teni – Joab le Abishai hi keiman kathunoi a kakoi din ahat behseh lhon'in ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin migiloupa chu athil phalou bol dungjuijin lethuh tahen,” ati.   
\c 4  
\s1 Ishbosheth Kitha  
\p
\v 1 Chuin Saul chapa Ishbosheth in Hebron munna Abner thi chung chang ajah chun ahansanna jouse abeitan chule Israel pumpi jong kichat nan adim tauvin ahi.  
\v 2 Tun Ishbosheth in sepai gallamkai Rimmon chateni Baanah le Recab chu aneijin, amani chu Benjamin phungmi Beeroth a cheng ahilhon e. Chule tun Beeroth khopi chu Benjamin te gamsung ahitan ahi.  
\v 3 Ajeh chu Beeroth mi mong-mong ho chu Gittaim ah ana jamlut un, tuni geijin khopem mi bangin acheng tauve.   
\p
\v 4 (Chuin Saul chapa Jonathan in chapa khat aneijin amin Mephibosheth akiti e, chule ama hi aneova pat elbai ahi. Jezreel a konna Saul le Jonathan gal mun'ah athi tai tithu ahung chun ama kum nga bou ahi nalaijin ahi. Hitobang thusoh chapangpa jenle nun ajahdoh phat in ama chu aman in ajampi tan ahi. Hinlah amanu akinoval jeh in chapangpa chu akheh sah tan ahileh ama chu akeng ahung bai tan ahi). \x + \xo 4:4 \xt 2 Samuel 9:3\x*   
\p
\v 5 Nikhat chu Beeroth akon Rimmon chapa teni Recab le Baanah chu Ishbosheth in'ah sun in agache lhon'in ahileh amapa chun sun kichol anabol in ahi.  
\v 6 Chuin kotngah a pangnun, chang ana sep in ahileh a imut sophat in ana imulha tan ahi. Hijeh chun Recab le Baanah jong chun amanu chu akalchuh lhon'in achepai lhon tai.  
\v 7 Insung alut lhon'in ahileh Ishbosheth lupna chunga analup amu lhon tan ahi. Hichun anailut lhon'in avolih lhon'in alol atanpeh lhon tan ahi. Chujouvin alu akichoi lhon'in Jordan phaicham geijin jankhovah hellin ajam lhon tan ahi.  
\v 8 Chuin Hebron alhun lhon'in Ishbosheth lu chu David ape lhon tan ahi. Chuin lengpa hengah apeng jah jeng lhon'in, “Ven!” hiche hi nagalmi nangma that dia kigo Saul chapa Ishbosheth luchang ahi. Tunin Pathen'in ka pakai lengpa dingin Saul le a insung mite chungah phu alatan ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Ahin David in Recab le Baanah jah ah hitin aseijin, “Ka Pathen, kagal mite jouse a kon eihuhdoh pa minna kasei ahi.  
\v 10 Khatvei mikhat in 'Saul athitai,' tin kakom'ah ahung seiye, amapa chun keima dia thupha hinpo dan a kigel hinte. Hinlah keiman ama chu kapui in Ziklag munnah kaga that tan ahi. Hichu ama dia ahin thupoh man a kapeh ahi. \x + \xo 4:10 \xt 2 Samuel 1:1-16\x*  
\v 11 Akhuti leh keiman kho hepha louva a insunga alupna a lumpa that migilou ho chu ichan geija kipaman kapeh ding hitam? Keiman ama thisan phu hi kalahda a leiset chunga jong ka suhmang da lhon ding ham? ati.   
\p
\v 12 Chuin David in amani that din agollhang ho chu thupeh aneijin, chule ama hon jong abol tauvin ahi. Chuin ama hon akhut, akeng atanpeh un atahsa chu Hebron twikul kom'ah akhai tauvin ahi. Chujouvin Ishbosheth lubuh chu achoi un Hebron mun'a Abner lhan ah chun avui tauvin ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Israel Mipi Jouse Chunga David Leng Ahi  
\p
\v 1 Chuin Israel phung mijouse Hebron munna David kom'a acheuvin ahengah hitin aseijui, “Keiho hi nangma tahsa le thisan jeng kahiuve.  
\v 2 Achesa phatlai a Saul kaleng'u ahilai jengin jong Israel sepai te ana lamkai chu nangma bou nahi. Chule Pakaijin nahengah aseijin, ‘Nangma hi kami Israel te chingpa nahi ding ahi. Nangma hi Israel te lamkai ding nahi.”’ atiuve.   
\p
\v 3 Hijeh chun Hebron munnah ahitin ahi, leng David in Pakai masang le Israel upaho jouse masangah kitepna khat asem tan ahi. Chuin ama hon Israel mite chunga leng din thao anu tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 David in lengvai ahinpoh chun atahsa kum somthum alhing tan ahi, chule kum somli sung lengvai anapon ahi. \x + \xo 5:4 \xt 1 Lgt 2:11; 1 Thusimbu 3:4; 29:27\x*  
\v 5 Chuin Judah mite chungah kum sagi le lhagup sung Hebron akon vai anahom in, chule Jerusalem akon'in Israel le Judah mite jouse chungah kum somthum le kum thum sung lengvai anahom in ahi.   
\s1 David In Jerusalem Alah  
\p
\v 6 Chuin David in asepai te alamkaijin Jerusalem lam'a Jebus mite toh kidou din ache tauvin, chule amaho hi agam a chengden mi mong-mong ho chu ahiuvin ahi. Chuin Jebus miten hitin David hengah ahin seiyui, “Nangho hiche mun ahin hunglut jou pouvin nate, mitcho le elbai ho jengin jong na deldoh jou diu ahi atiuve!” Ajeh chu amaho hi bitkeija umdan a kigel'u ahi. \x + \xo 5:6 \xt Joshua 15:63; Thutan Vaihom Ho 1:21\x*  
\v 7 Ahinlah David in khopi dettah Zion khopi chu alatan ahi, tunin hiche mun chu David khopi akiti tai.   
\p
\v 8 Chuche aga bulu nikhou chun David in a sepai ho hengah hitin aseiye, “Keiman Jebus mi mitcho ho leh elbai ho chu kavet nompoi. Koi hileh aga bulu ding ho chu twilam apat khopi sunga lut diu ahi.” Hichu thu kisei abul ahi, “Mitcho ho leh elbai ho chu insung lut manlou maithei u ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun David in akulpiu chu a inmun in asemin chule David khopi asah tan ahi. Chule David in khopi sung chu achung langah ahin panin asung lang geijin akehlet ben ahi.  
\v 10 Hiti chun David jong ahung thahat cheh-cheh jengin ahi, ajeh chu Pakai Van Pathen sepai ten ama aumpi jeh u ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Tyre gam'a lengpa Hiram in David hengah sottolle ho chu Cedar thingho, thingthem bol ho, song insathem ho chutoh asol than ama hon David leng inpi asahpeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Hichun David in Pakaijin Israel mite jouse chunga leng dia atunna le ami Israel te khohsahna jalla alenggam phatthei aboh chu ahin geldoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hebron akon Jerusalem akichon doh jou chun, David in ajiding le thaikem ding akipui ben, chule ama hon chapa le chanu ahinbe peh un ahi.  
\v 14 Hiche ho hi David chapa te Jerusalem a peng ho min ahi: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,  
\v 15 Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia,  
\v 16 Elishama, Eliada, chule Eliphelet ahiuve.   
\s1 David In Philistine Te Ajo  
\p
\v 17 Chuin Philistine ten David chu Israel te leng dia thao akinu ajahdoh phat un, ama hon asepai te jouse chu David man din akigot sah tauvin ahi. Hinlah amaho ahungu chu David akiseipeh tan, hichun ama kulpidet lam'a ache tan ahi.  
\v 18 Chuin Philistine te jong ahung lhungun chule Rephaim phaicham lam geiyin akithe thang tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Hichun David in Pakai adongin, “Keima kapotdoh a hiche Philistine mite hi kaga kisatpi ding ham? Nangman amaho chunga galjona neipeh ding ham?” ati.  
\p Chuin Pakaijin David ahin donbut in, “Henge, chijengin. Keiman amaho khu nangma khut a kapeh tei ding ahi.” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Chuin David in Baal–perazim lam ajonin hiche mun a chun Philistine te ajou tan ahi. Chuin David in hitin aseiye, “Pakai bol ahi!” aman kamelma jouse twi kithe thang bangin athe thang tan ahi. Hijeh chun aman hiche mun chu Baal–perazim asah tan ahi (hichu Pakaijin athethang, tina ahi).  
\v 21 Philistine miten hiche mun a chun amilimdoi hou chu adalhauvin, chule David le asepai ten amaho chu ala tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Chuin phat chomkhat jouvin Philistine mite chu akile kit un, chule Rephaim phaicham geijin aga kithe thang kit un ahi.  
\v 23 Chule David in ipi kabol ding ham tin Pakai chu adong kit in ahileh. Pakaijin hitin ahin donbut in, “Jangkei a na cheuva naga bulu tah lou diu ahi,” “Hinlah anung lam uva kon na umkol diu chuteng poplar thing kom akon na bulu diu ahi.  
\v 24 Chule nang hon poplar thing chung lam'a mikijot kengto gin najah teng ule kiging sadem a naum diu ahi! Hichu Philistine mite chunga galjona nanei theina diuva Pakaijin na chungvum uva nalhonpi nau melchihna hi ding ahi.”  
\v 25 Hijeh chun David injong Pakaijin athupeh bang chun abollin, Philistine mite jouse chu Gibeon apat Gezer chan geijin athat gamtan ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Kitepna Thingkhong Jerusalem Akilhut  
\p
\v 1 Chuin David in avellin Israel mi gal-hang 30,000 kilhengdoh ho chu akoukhom kit in ahi.  
\v 2 David in amaho chu alamkaijin Judah gam'a Baalah kom'a Pathen Thingkhong chu gale poh din ache tauvin, hichu Van Pathen Sepai ho minna kikou, alai a Cherub laltouna um chu ahi. \x + \xo 6:2 \xt Potdohbu 25:22\x*  
\v 3 Hichun Pathen Thingkhong chu bongkang thah chungah aheng'un chule molchung lam'a Abinadab in'a kon ahin pudoh tauvin, chule Abinadab chapa teni Uzzah le Ahio chun bongkang chu ahintol lhon'in ahi. \x + \xo 6:3 \xt 1 Samuel 7:1,2\x*  
\v 4 Pathen Thingkhong kipohna chu. Chule Ahio chu thingkong masangah achen ahi.  
\v 5 Chuin David le Israel mipi jouse chun Pakai masang'ah la asauvin, chule tumging thei jouse – pengkul, selangdah, khongpi, selki, chule sumlheng jouse suging pumin golnop abol tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ahinlah ama hon Nacon changphol mun ahin phah uchun bongchal teni chu akipal lhu lhon'in ahileh Uzzah chun akhut ajahdoh gangchal in Pathen Thingkhong chu atuh tan ahi.  
\v 7 Hichun Pathen lunghanna chu Uzzah chungah achutan hijeh chun Pathen'in Uzzah chu amun maman Pathen Thingkhong kom'ah chun athat tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Pathen'in Uzzah chunga alunghan ahin boh lhah jeng jeh chun David alung phamo lheh tan ahi. Hijeh chun aman hiche mun chu Perez–Uzzah asah tan ahi (hichu Uzzah chunga thunoh lhunna mun tina ahi), tuni chanin akisah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hiche thilsoh jouva pat chun David in Pakai chu akicha lheh tan, hijeh chun aman Pakai chu adong tan, “Iti keiman Pakai Thingkhong hi keima vetsuina noiya kahin le choilut thei ding ham?” ati.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun David in Pakai Thingkhong chu David khopi a pohlut lou din pha asah tai. Hinlah Gath mi Obed–edom insung joh a apolut tan ahi.  
\v 11 Pakai Thingkhong chu Obed–edom insungah lhathum sung aumden nalai in, hijeh chun Obed–edom le a insung pumpi chu Pakaijin phatthei aboh tan ahi. \x + \xo 6:11 \xt 1 Thusimbu 26:4,5\x*   
\p
\v 12 Hichun leng David chu hitin akiseipeh tan ahi, “Pakaijin Pathen Thingkhong jeh chun Obed–edom insung pumpi le anei jouse phatthei abohtan ahi.” Hijeh chun David jong achen Pathen Thingkhong chu Obed–edom insunga kon David Khopi lam'ah kipa golnop loupi tah pumin ahin potan ahi.  
\v 13 Chuin Pakai Thingkhong puhon kalgup ason jou un, David in bongchal le bongnou thaochet in kilhaina abol tan ahi.  
\v 14 Chuin David chun thempu ho sangkhol chol akiah in athaneina jouse pumin Pakai angsung'ah alam tan ahi.  
\v 15 Hichun David le Israel mipi jouse chun Pakai Thingkhong chu kipah thong jeju le kelchaki mutging toh thon aputou tauvin ahi.   
\s1 David Chunga Michal Alung Himo  
\p
\v 16 Ahin Pakai Thingkhong chu David khopi alhut tauvin ahileh, Saul chanu Michal chun abang kot akon ahin suhvet tan ahi. Chuin amanun leng David Pakai angsunga akhut alea alam chu amutan ahileh amanu chu David chungah lung himo nan adim tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin Pakai Thingkhong chu ahinpu uvin David in akoina dia asem ponbuh sungah chun akoi tauvin ahi. Chuin David in Pakai angah kilhainan govam thilto le chamna thilto anei tan ahi.  
\v 18 Chuin kilhaina abolchaijin, David in mipi jouse chu Van Pathen Sepai te minin phatthei aboh tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Chuin Israel pasal jouse le numei jouse chu changlhah phengkhat cheh, sachan khat cheh, le lengpi theija kisem changlhah khat cheh ahoppeh un ahi. Chujouvin mipi jouse chu a inlam cheh uva akile tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 6:19 \xt 1 Thusimbu 16:43\x*   
\p
\v 20 Hiti chun David in ama insung mite phattheiboh ding tia inlam akile chun, Saul chanu Michal ama kimupi din ahung potdoh in ahi. Amanun jalou tah in hitin aseiye, “Iti jachat um hitam tuni Israel lengpan mingol khat in abol ding tobanga asaguh keuva asoh numeiho masanga aum jeng chu!” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin David in Michal chu alethuh in, “Keima Pakai napa te le a insung mite jouse chung vum'a eilhengpa! Pathen mi Israel te chunga lamkai dia einganse pa masanga chu kipah a lam kahi.  
\v 22 Henge, hisanga ngoljo a um ding jong kanom'e chule keima mitmu tah a kineosah ding jong! Ahin soh numei na minphah ho vang chun keima hi chingtah a eigel diu ahi!” ati.  
\v 23 Hiti chun Saul chanu Michal chu ahinkho lhumkei jin chanei louvin aum tan ahi.   
\c 7  
\s1 David Dinga Pathen Kitepna  
\p
\v 1 Leng David aleng inpia aum chun Pakaijin akimvel a agal mite jouse a kon'in kicholdona apetan,  
\v 2 chuin lengpan Themgao Nathan kom'ah hitin aseijin, “Ven, Keima cedar in hoitah sungah kachengin, ahin Pathen Thingkhong chu ponbuh sungah aum jing nalaiye!” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin Nathan in lengpa chu adonbut in, “Chetan nangman nalunga umcheng chu gaboldoh tan, ajeh chu Pakaijin nangma naumpin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Ahin chuche jan ma chun Pakaijin Nathan hengah aseijin,   
\b  
\pmo
\v 5 “Chenlang kasohpa David khu gaseipeh tan, 'Hiche hi ahi Pakaijin aphondoh chu: Nangma hi nahim keima chenna ding insa ding chu?  
\v 6 Keima in’a kacheng khapoi, Israel mite Egypt gam'a kahin puidoh nikho apat tuni chan geijin. Amavang ponbuh le Houbuh a keima kaum jingin hiti chun munkhat akon munkhat ah kakichon jingin ahi.  
\v 7 Keima Israel mite toh hoilai mun a kache nau hijongleh, khatvei jeng jong Israel phung lamkai chule kami Israel te chinghoi ho jah ah, “Ipi dinga keima chenna ding Cedar in hoitah neisahpeh lou uham? tin kana phun khapoi.'”   
\pm
\v 8 “Tun chenlang gasei tan kasoh David hengah, “Pakai van janel in hitin aseiye: Keiman nangma hi hamhing lah a kelngoi nachinna akon kami Israel te lamkai dinga kalhen nahi.”  
\v 9 Nangma hoilai mun nachena hijongleh keiman kahin lhonpi jingin, chule nagal mite jouse namitmu tah in kasumang tai. Chule tua hi keiman leiset chunga mi minthang khat banga namin kakithan sah ding ahi!  
\v 10 Chule keiman kami Israel te achenna diu mun khat kapeh ding, hiche mun a chu boina umlouva dettah a kaphudet diu ahi. Achesa a banga migilou nam miten asuhboi thei tahlou diu ahi.  
\v 11 Kami Israel te chunga vaihom dia thutan vaihom ho kalhen nikhoa pat ana chuti ahi. Chule keiman nagal miteu jousea kon choldona kapeh diu ahi.  
\pm Chukalval'in, Pakaijin aseijin aman nangma In khat nasah peh ding–leng insung katun doh peh ding ahi!  
\v 12 Ajeh chu nangma nahung thia chule napu napa tetoh nahung kivui jou teng, keiman nangma chilhah, na taiguiya peng mong-mong khat kahin tundoh ding, chule keiman alenggam chu ka thahat sah ding ahi. \x + \xo 7:12 \xt Labu 89:3,4; 132:11; Jn 7:42; Act 2:30\x*  
\v 13 Ama chun keima min'a in khat asah ding chule keiman alenggam chu atonsot a kasuhdet peh ding ahi.  
\v 14 Keima ama pa kahi ding chule ama kachapa hi ding ahi. Ijem tia achonset khah tah leh, mipa khat in acha abolna banga keiman ama chu kamoljol'a kasuhdih a kasuhgim ding ahi. \x + \xo 7:14 \xt Labu 89:26,27; 2 Crth 6:18; Heb 1:5\x*  
\v 15 Ahin ka mihepina Saul chunga kalah manga, na mitmua kon katol mang banga ama chunga vang kalah mang louhel ding ahi.  
\v 16 Chule na insung le na lenggam chu imatih channa kamasanga um jing jeng ding, chule nalaltouna chu imatih channa bitkeicha um jing ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 7:16 \xt Labu 89:36,37\x*   
\b  
\m
\v 17 Hijeh chun Nathan Themgaopa chu David hengah akinung len Pakaijin gaova aseipeh cheng chu agaseipeh tan ahi.   
\s1 David Kipana Taona  
\m
\v 18 Chuin leng David chu Pakai angsung'ah alut in chule atou in atao tan ahi,  
\b  
\pmo “O thaneipen Pakai, kei koi kahi a, ka insung hi ipi hija hichan geija neihin puilhung ham?  
\v 19 Chule tunjong thaneipen Pakaijin, ima jouse chungvum in nasohpa lenggam hi atonsot a peh ding nati e! Hiti monga hi mijouse toh na-na kitep mong hinam? O thaneipen Pakai.   
\pm
\v 20 “Keiman nahenga ipi kaseibe ding ham? Thaneipen Pakai, Nangman nasohpa hi itobang kahi nahesoh nai.  
\v 21 Ajeh chu nangman na kitepna bang le nangma lungdei bangin thil jouse hi loupi tah in nabollin chule nasohpa neihet sah sohtai.   
\pm
\v 22 “Iti loupi nahi tam, O thaneipen Pakai! Nangma bang koima aumpoi. Chule keima hon nang tobang Pathen dang kana jakha hihhel uve.  
\v 23 Leiset chunga hi namdang nami Israel te tobang umkha em? Namdang ho hi ipi hiu ham O Pathen, nangman asoh channa uva kon namite dia nahuhdoh mong em? Nangman namite Egypt akon nahuhdoh chun nangma min na suloupin ahi. Chule nangman bolmo kidang loupi tah na bollin namdang te leh a pathen hou chu namite masanga kon na delmang sohhel'e. \x + \xo 7:23 \xt Danbu Ni Na 4:34\x*  
\v 24 Chule nangman Israel mite chu imatih channa namite din nasemin, chule nangma, O Pakai a Pathen'u nahitai.   
\pm
\v 25 “Chule tun, O Pakai le ka Pathen, keima nasohpa kahi; nangma na kitepna bang chun keima leh ka insung chungah bol tan. Chule atonsot a um jing din na kitepna chu phutdet tan.  
\v 26 Chule namin imatih chanin jaum hen khuti leh mijousen seijun tin, 'Van Sepai te Pakai chu Pathen chu Israel te Pathen ahi!' Chule nasohpa David insung chu na masangah imatih chanin um jing hen.   
\pm
\v 27 “O Van Sepai te Pakai, Israel te Pathen, keiman hiche taona neina ding hin hansanna kanei e ajeh chu nangman hiche ho jouse hi nasohpa hengah na phongdoh in, hitin naseiye, ‘Keiman nangma ding leng In ka sahdoh peh ding nahi nati!’  
\v 28 Ajeh chu nangma Pathen, Thaneipen Pakai nahi. Na thusei ho adih sohkei in, chule hitobang thilpha jouse hi nasohpa din nakitem e.  
\v 29 Chule tun, nasohpa insung phatthei boh ding hi nangma lunglhaina hihen, khuti leh atonsot a nangma angsunga kaum jing thei diu ahi. Ajeh chu nangma thaneipen Pakaijin naseijin, nasohpa phatthei boh ding nati chu, atonsot-atonsot a phattheina ahi.”   
\c 8  
\s1 David Sepai ten Gal Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun David lengpan Philistine mite dia akhopiu lenpen Gath khopi chu gal in alatan, hijeh chun Philistine mite chu ajou in chule asunem sohtan ahi.  
\v 2 Chule David chun Moab mite jong gal’in akisatpin ahileh ajou kit in, amite chu asimtoh chet in, hichun abonchan tol'a alupsah sohkeiyin, hiti chun agol'in akigol sah sohkeiyin, hiche golni channa geiya kigol ho jouse chu tha din thu apen, ahin adangse vang chu ahing hoiyin, hiche ahinghoi ho chengse vang chu David dingin soh in apang sohkei tauve.   
\p
\v 3 David chun Euphrates vadung geija agam akehlet nom jeh in achepeh in Zobah lengpa Rehob chapa Hadadezer jong gal’in akisatpin ahileh ajou kittai.  
\v 4 Hadadezer khut a kon'in David chun sakolkang 1,000 le sakol touthem mi 7,000 amanin, chule kenga galbol sepai 20,000 aman e; chujongleh sakol kangtalai 100 kai ding tilou adangse chu akeng atanboh peh sohkei tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Damascus apat Areamea te chu Hadadezer lengpa kithopi dia ahung uchun, David in mi 22,000 athat un ahi.  
\v 6 Chujouvin David chun Aramea gamsunga Damascus khopia jong sepai hon khat atousah tan ahi; hiti chun Aramea mite jong chu David soh ahiuvin, don le kai ima apeji uve. Hitobang hin David chu agalkon na chan'ah Pakaijin galjona apejingin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hadadezer sepai te manchah sana ompho jouse chu David in alan Jerusalem a ahin polut sohkeiyin ahi.  
\v 8 Hichun Hadadezer khopi te ni Tebah le Berothai a kon'in jong David chun sum-eng tamtah jong ahin chom doh kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chuin Hamath lengpa Toi kitipan jong Hadadezer sepai te abonchan David in gal in akisat pin ahileh ajou tai, ti ajah doh phat in,  
\v 10 Toi lengpan jong achapa Joram chu David lengpa kom'a salam bolgunset din asoltan ahi. Ipi jeh-inem itileh David chun Hadadezer kitipa gal a akisatpia ajo jeh ahi; ajeh chu Hadadezer hin Toi lengpa akisatpi jing jeng anahi. Joram hin dangka le sana chule sum-eng ahin pohpeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun David in Joram thil hinpoh chengse chu alan aman achomdoh namtin vaipi a konna gal ajo tengleh akilah dangka le sana jouse pumin Pakaiya athenso tha tai.  
\v 12 Hiche thil ho hi Edom, Moab, Ammon, Philistia, chule Amalek—chule Zobah lengpa Reboh chapa Hadadezer chapa a konna achom doh chengse jong ajaovin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Chuin ahung kile kit lamin jong chikhuh phaicham a Edom mite mihem 18,000 ahin that pa kit in ahileh David chu aminthang cheh tan ahi \x + \xo 8:13 \xt Labu 60\x*  
\v 14 David chun Edom gamsunga jong sepai atousah in, hijeh chun Edom mite jong abonchauvin David soh ahisoh tauve. Hitobang tah hin David chu gal a konna chan a Pakaijin gal ajosah sah jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 David chun Israel pumpi chunga lengvai anapon, chule amite adin apha le adih jeng anabol in ahi.  
\v 16 Zeruiah chapa Joab chu sepai lamkaiyin ana pangin, Ahilud chapa Jehoshaphat chu leng thuchingin ana pangin ahi.  
\v 17 Ahitub chapa Zadok le Abiathar chapa Ahimelech chu thempun ana pang lhon'in ahi; chule Seraiah kitipa chu lekha sunin ana pangin ahi.  
\v 18 Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu lengpa vengbit ho lamkaijin ana pangin; chule David chapa teho chu thempu ho lamkaijin apang uvin ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 David In Mephibosheth Akhotona  
\p
\v 1 “Nikhat David in adongin, Saul insung mite khat beh ahing naum nalai uvem? Jonathan jal'a keiman khotona kamusah thei ding tin adongin ahile, \x + \xo 9:1 \xt 1 Samuel 20:15-17\x*  
\v 2 Saul insunga soh natong ho lah a mi khat anaum khan ama chu amin Ziba akiti; Hichun lengpan jong amapa chu adongin, “Nang hi Ziba nahi hinam?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Hichun Ziba in jong adonbut in “Henge, keima Ziba chu kahinai,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Chuin lengpan adongin, “Saul insung mi khat beh ahingdoh um nalai louham? Aum leh keiman Pathen mi khotona chu kamusah nom uve,” ati.  
\p Ziba'n jong lengpa ahin donbut in, “Henge, Jonathan chapa khat aum nalaije. Ama hi akengphang te ni chatmoa kibai ahi,” atipeh e. \x + \xo 9:3 \xt 2 Samuel 4:4\x*   
\p
\v 4 Chuphat in lengpan jong, “Ama chu hoiya umham?” tin ahin dong tan ahi.  
\p Ziban lengpa chu aseipeh in, “Ama chu Lodebar khoa Ammiel chapa Makir in a um ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun David lengpan mi asolin, ama chu Makir in'a kon'in aga puidoh sah tai.  
\v 6 Hiti hin Saul tupa Jonathan chapa Mephibosheth kitipa chu David kom'a ahungin alu kunin jana apen ahi. Chuin David chun ahoupin, “Mephibosheth, atileh;  
\p Mephibosheth in jong, “Keima nasohpa kahi,” tin adonbut’e.   
\p
\v 7 Hichun David in akom'a hitin aseiye, “Kicha hih in, keiman napa Jonathan jal a nang hi kakhoto ding, chujongleh khatvei napu Saul nei le gou ana hikhasa jouse chu aboncha nangma kapeh kit ding nahi; chule nangman hiche leng ankong phunga hi keima toh an naneh khom ding ahiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Mephibosheth jong chun jana apekit in aseikit e, “Nasohpa kei hi ipi kahiya nangin hiche uicha thisa tobang chunga hi khotona nei musah khoh ding ham?” atitai.   
\p
\v 9 David lengpan Saul sohpa Ziba chu akouvin akom'a hitin aseipeh’e, “Ipi hijongleh Saul thilkeo anei jouse leh ama insung mite nei jouse chu aboncha hiche napu chapa hi kapeh ahitai.  
\v 10 Hijeh a chu napu chapa hin anneh akimu jouna dinga nangma le na chapa te, chule nasoh ten ama dinga lou nabol peh dingu ahin, alousohga nahin pohpehji dingu ahi; ahin hiche Mephibosheth napu tupa vang hin keima ankong phunga an aneh jing jeng ding ahi,” tin thu apetai. Ziba kitipa hin chapa som le nga ana neijin, soh jong somni jen aneijin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Ziba in lengpa kom'a aseijin, “Kapu lengpan nasohpa keima nei thupeh bang-bang chun nasohpa hin gabol nange,” ati. Hiti chun hiche nikho apat chun Mephobisheth hin lengpa chate lah a khatpen bangin David ankong phunga chun an anejing jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Mephibosheth jong hin chapa gollhang khat aneijin, amin jong chu Mica ahi. Chu nikhoa pat chun Mephibosheth soh natong din Ziba insung mite abonchan apang tauvin ahi.  
\v 13 Hiti hin Mephibosheth akengphang teni kibaipa chu Jerusalem'a achengin, chule aniseh in leng ankong ah an anejing tan ahi.   
\c 10  
\s1 David In Ammon Mite Ajo  
\p
\v 1 Hiche jou phat chomkhat jouvin, Ammon mite Lengpa Nahash chu athitan, hijeh chun achapa Hanun kitipan Ammon mite chungah lengvai ahinpo tan ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun David in jong aseijin, “Nahash chapa Hanun hi apan keima jana neitah a eina bol bang-banga ken jong amahi jana neitah a kabol ding ahi,” tin anaseiye. Hijeh chun David in jong sottolle ho asol’in Hanun chu apa thi jeh a lhemmong din asolpeh e.  
\p Ahin David sottolle ho chu Ammon mite gamsunga aga lhun phat un,  
\v 3 Ammon mite lamkai hon apupau Hanun kom'a chun aseiyuvin, ‘Nangman hiche miho hi napa jabol dinga hiche mun a hi hunga na gelthei mong hinam? Ahipoi! David in khopi hi hunga suhgam ding agot jeh a sottolle ho hi khopi sung kholtoh leh velhi le dinga ahinsol ahi bouve, tin aseipeh tauve.  
\v 4 Hijeh chun Hanun hin David sottolle ho chu abonchauvin aman in melse tah in akhamul akeh langkhat avo chaipeh sohkeiyin, chule aponsil ule akivon nau akimlai tah akongbuh dontah achetan peh sohkeiyun jachat umtah in anungsol tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun David sohte chunga thusoh ho David in ajahdoh phat in, amite ho thu gaseipeh din mi asoltan ahi “Nakhamul’u akikhan lhit kit masang sen Jericho khopia hung umden unlang akikhan lhit tengleh hung kile kit tauvin,” tin thu ahiltai. Ajeh chu amaho hin alimsou chu ajachatpi mong-mong u ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Chujouvin Ammon miten ichan geija David chu asuh lunghang u akihet doh phat uvin, Ammon mite akihoutoh uvin Bethrehob a cheng Aramea mite leh Zobah a cheng Aramea mite tol'a panga galsat sepai 20,000 thalah ding leh, Maacah lengpa le amite 1,000 thalah ding chule Tob mite 12,000 thalah dingin mi asol tauve.  
\v 7 Hiche thusoh David lengpan ajah doh phat in lamkai Joab le asepai te mihat chengse chu abonchauvin gal boldin asoltai.  
\v 8 Chuin Ammon mite chu ahung kitoldoh uvin kelkot phunga chun galsat din akigol tauve; chule Aramea mite Zobah le Rehob khoa kon leh Tob le Maacah mite chu mun onglen laiyah akigol tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Joab chun amasanglam le anunglam'a gal miten atingtanto tai, ti amudoh phat in, Israel lah a mi son um lhentum cheh phabep alhengdoh in, Aramea mite dou din mun onglai ah apansah tai.  
\v 10 Chule mi amoh chengse chu asopipa Abishai lamkai peh din akoiyin, Abishaiyin asopite chengse chu Ammon mite toh kisatto din agoltoh tai.  
\v 11 Chuin Joab in aseitai, “Aramea mite hi Keima dinga ahat behseh jeng uva ahileh nangman neihung kithopin lang, chule Ammon mite chu nang dinga ahatval behseh jeng uva ahi jongleh keima hung ing ting nahung kithopi nange, ati.  
\v 12 Hijeh chun hangtah in hung pang uvin lang, imiteu ding leh I-Pathen’u khopi jouse din pasal jouse chu hatah in pangu hitin; chule Pakai lungdei chu guilhung tahen,”ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hiti hin Joab le ama toh pang khom sepaiho chun Aramea mite chu asat panun ahileh; Aramea mite chu ajamcheh gam tauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Aramea mite jam chu Ammon miten jong amudoh phat uvin amaho jong chutobangma chun Abishai masanga ajam uvin akhopi sunga alhailut tauvin ahi. Hichun Ammon mite toh akisat nauva kon'in Joab jong Jerusalem'a ahung kile kit tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Aramea miten Israel chate toh kidinte joulou ding ahiu chu ahin kihetdoh phat un ahung kithah gopkhom kit uvin,  
\v 16 Hadadezer kitipan asol in Euphrates Vadung gal a cheng Aramea mite aga kousah in ahileh, amaho jong Hadadezer sepai lamkaipa Shobach lamkai nan Helam geiyin ahung kitol’uvin Aramea mite ahinjop kit un ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin David in hitobang thil umchan chu ajah phat in, aman jong Israel chate pumpi akhom-khom sohkeijin chule Jordan ahung galkaijin Helam channah a sepai te ahin puilhung tan ahi. Hichun Aramea mite jong David lengpa dou din achamtah un anapang uvin akisatpi tauve.  
\v 18 Ahinlah Aramea mite chu Israel te masanga ajam kit tauvin ahi. Hichea hin David sepai ten Aramea sepai sakol touthem ho mi 700 le tol'a pang sepai 40,000 chule agal lamkaipau Shobach kitipa jaonan athat tauvin ahi.  
\v 19 Chuin Lengte jousen Hadadezer toh akitho vang uva Israel te ajolou u amudoh phat un, Israel mite khut ah akipelut un amaho noijah aum tauvin ahi. Hiche jouva pat chun Aramea mite chun Ammon mite kithopi ding chu akicha tauvin ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 David Le Bathsheba  
\p
\v 1 Chavang lai le chonna ngai dan a anaum leng ho galkon phat laiyin David jong chun Joab le asepai te toh Israel chate abonchan galkon din asoltai; amaho jong acheuvin Ammon sepai te agasumang un, chule Rabbah kho aga um tauve. Ahin David vang chu Jerusalem khopia aumden jing nai. \x + \xo 11:1 \xt 1 Thusimbu 20:1\x*   
\p
\v 2 Nikhat hi nilhah lam ni kihei don hin David jong asun cholna jalkhun'a kon'in athoudoh in leng Inpi inchunga chun avahlen ahileh, inchunga kon chun numei mel-hoi khat akisil pettah amun ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun David in mi asol in numeinu chu koi ham, tin agadoh le sah tai. Hichea hin mi khat chun, “Hiche nu hi Eliam chanu, Hit mipa Uriah jinu Bathsheba chu ahi” tin aseipeh tai.  
\v 4 Hichun David in mi sottol le ho asol in amanu chu aga puisah in, Bathsheba jong chu leng inpi sung ahung lut in, chuin David chun amanu chu aluppi tan ahi. Hiche pet a hi Bathsheba chu athi neijou akisuh theng jou chabou ahi; akichaiyin amanu jong a inlama achetai.  
\v 5 Phat chomkhat jouvin Bathsheba'n nao avop ahin kihetdoh phat in aman David kom'a hitin thu athot in, “Keiman nao kavop tai,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun David in Joab chu thu athot in: “Uriah kitipa Hit mipa chu kaheng'a hinsol temin,” ati. Hijeh chun Joab in jong Uriah chu David lengpa hengah ahinsol tan ahi.  
\v 7 Chuin Uriah chu David kom ahung lhun phat in, David in jong Joab umchan chule mipi itobang banga um uva chule agalsat u machal jing hinam tin adongin ahi.  
\v 8 Chujouvin David in Uriah kom'a aseitai, ‘Na inlam'a chen lang gakichol tan,” ati. Leng inpi adalhah chun David in Uriah dingin thilpeh jong athot in ahi.  
\v 9 Ahivangin Uriah chu inlang achepon, lengpa kotpi phung bul'a kotkhah ngah ho toh chun hiche jan chun alumden tan ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hichun David in Uriah a inlam achelou ahin hetdoh phat chun, akouvin ipi jeh ham ti adong tan ahi, “Kholgam a konna hunglhung nahilou ham, ibola na inlam'a chelouva naum ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun Uriah in David kom'a aseijin, “Pathen Thingkhong le Israel chate chule Judah mite lhambuh jenga cheng ahiuvin, kapu sepai te kapupa Joab le asepai te jong tollhang lah a ngahmun mai-maiya cheng ahiuve. Ipi dinga keima in'a kachea kadudu kaneh a atui-tui kadon a kajinu angsunga nomtah a kalup ding ham? Nangma damlai sung le nahinkho phatlai sungsen keiman hitobang kinopsahna thil hi bol ponge,’ tin aseiye.   
\p
\v 12 Chuphat in David chun Uriah kom'a aseijin, “Aphai, tunin jong hikom'a umtan, jing tengleh na vaikon doh sah nange,” atitai. Hijeh chun Uriah jong chuche nikho le ajing nikho chun Jerusalem'a anichongtan ahi.  
\v 13 Chuin David in Uriah chu, ama kom'a anne ding leh lengpitwi don dingin akouvin; chuin ama chu lengpitwi adon kham sah tai; chuche jou jengin jong a inlam'a ajinu kom chedin asoldoh jou dehpon, nilhah lamin Uriah chu kelkot ngah sepai te chutoh lumkhom din ajalkhun akijot kit tan ahi.   
\s1 Uriah Thina Ding David In Agon  
\p
\v 14 Chuin Ajing jingkah chun David in Joab lekha khat athot in hichu Uriah khut a agah thot e.  
\v 15 Lekha sunga hin David chun hitin asun e, “Uriah hi gal kisatna ahahlai laiya amasan pansah uvin lang chutengleh gal miten atha tei-tei nadin ama achangseh in dalhauvin,” tin asun e.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun Joab injong khopi khat aum phat in mihat tah-tah panmun ahi, tia ahetsa bangkom laitah a chun Uriah chu apansah tan ahi.  
\v 17 Chuin khopi sunga sepai te ahung kondoh uvin Joab chutoh akisat tauvin ahi; chule hiche mun a chun Hit mi Uriah jaonan mipi lah a David sepai te phabep jong athat tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hichun Joab in jong mi asol'in gal kisat umchan jouse chu David kom'a aga lhutsah tai.  
\v 19 Hichun asottolle mipa chu ahilchah masan, “Lengpa kom'a chu gal kisat thusim aboncha nasei sohkei ding ahi, ati.  
\v 20 Ahin ijem tia lengpa alung han jeng tah a nang kom'a, ‘Ibola chutobang'a chu khopi na nailut jeng uva kisatpi dinga nacheu baham? Kulpi bang dunga konna nahin kap jeng diu nahet louvu ham?  
\v 21 Chule Gideon chapa Abimelech chu koi tha ham? Bangvum'a konna numei khat in sumhei song ahin lhah sah leh alhah khum khah a hijeh a chu Thebez kiti laiya chu thiden hilou ham? Ibola hitobang tah a chu bang na nailut jengu ham?’ tia asei leh; nangman, ‘Nasohpa Hit mi Uriah jong athi tai,’ tia na seipeh ding ahi,” tin ahil’e. \x + \xo 11:21 \xt Thutan Vaihom Ho 9:53\x*   
\p
\v 22 Hichun sottolle pa chu Jerusalem ahungin David kom'a Joab in asol lona jouse chu abonchan aseipeh sohkei tan ahi.  
\v 23 Hichun sottolle pa chun David hengah hitin aseiye, “Gal miten keiho eihin joujo tauvin, keiho dou nan tollhanga ahung kitoldoh jeng uve; ahivangin keihon jong kelkot phung lam chanin kale dellut kit uvin ahi.  
\v 24 Chuin galmi thalpi kap them hon banga kon'in nasohte lengpa sepai phabep jong ahin kaplih tauvin, chule nasohpa Uriah jeng jong athitai,’ ati.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun David jong chun sottolle pa kom'a chun aseijin, “Nangman Joab kom'a hitia hi nasei ding ahi; Hiche thilsoh jeh hin nangma lung lhadai hih in, ajeh chu chemjamin khat-khat a aban tan-tan ahitai; aban teng natha hatsah jon lang khopi chu delkhumin, tin seipeh in, hiti chun Joab chu atilkhou tan,’ ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Chuin Uriah jinun ajipa Uriah chu athitai, ti ajahdoh phat in ajipa dingin akap in apul adoutan ahi.  
\v 27 Amanu pul douna phat akichaijin David in mi asolin amanu chu leng inpi sungah aga puilut sah tai, chule Bathsheba in David chu chapa khat ahinpeh tai. Hinla David thilbol achonna chungah Pakai alung lhai tapon ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Nathan Themgaopan David Aphosal  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun Nathan themgaopa chu Pakaijin David kom'ah asol tan ahi: Hichun Nathanin jong David kom'a hitin aga seiye, “Khopi sung khat a hin pasal ni acheng lhon'in, khatpa chu mihao ahin, khat jopa vang chu mivaicha ahi. \x + \xo 12:1 \xt Labu 51\x*  
\v 2 Hichun mihaopa hin kelngoi hon tamtah le bonghon tampi aneijin ahi.  
\v 3 Ahin mivaichapa vang chun imacha aneipoi, ahin aman alel-lel a akichoh kelngoipi khat seh-seh aneiye. Hijongleh aman akelngoipi chu akivah vah in achate toh phate chan avah in ahi; kelngoipi hin ama changlhah aneh ding an jong aneijin, adon ding twi jong ama khon sunga kon'in adonji e; chutengleh a angsunga alumjin, achanu tobang bangin aum tan ahi.  
\v 4 Hiche lai hin kholjin mikhat mihaopa kom'a chun ahunglhungin ahileh, hiche kholjinpa thapeh ding chun mihaopan jong ama kelngoi hon lah a khattou thapeh ding jong a-ittan, chule ama bonghon lah a konna khattou thapeh ding jong a-it tai; ahin mivaichapa kelngoipi khat seh anei chu aman in akom'a hung kholjin pa ding chun atha peh tan ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Chutah chun David jong alunghangjah jengin hiche mihaopa douna chun Nathan themgao kom'a chun hitin aseitai, “Pakai hingjing min'a kasei ahi, hitobanga kisa chonvalpa chu thi dinga kilom mong ahi bouve!  
\v 6 Chujongleh aman voujang natna beihel'a hitobang thil pihi abol jeh hin aman kelngoipi chu ajat li a asah kit ding ahi,’ atitai.   
\p
\v 7 Chuin Nathan themgaopan David kom'a aseipai jengin, “Hichea kisei mihaopa hi nangma nahi, Pakai Israel Pathen'in hitin aseiye, ‘Nang hi keiman Israel chate chunga leng chang dinga thao kanusa nahin, chule Saul thaneina a kon kana huhdoh nahiye.  
\v 8 Chujongleh napupa Saul’in, ajiteu jouse chule Israel insung pumpi le Judah insung pumpi jong kapeh nahi; hicheng jong hi alhom behseh nahlaiya ahileh tamtah kapehbe ding nahi nalaiye.  
\v 9 Chuti ahileh ipi dinga nangman Pakai thusei nanot thap a hitobang tijat umtah thil hi nabol hitam? Nangman Hit mipa Uriah chu na dengin Ammon mite chemjamin nathat nin, chule ajinu jong naji din nakipui jeng theiye.  
\v 10 Hijeh a chu tua hi nangma insunga konna jong chemjam lang jing jeng ding ahi. ajeh chu nangin keima nahsah mon neibol'in, Hit mipa Uriah jinu chu naji din nakipuitai,’ tin aseiye.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin Pakaijin hitin aseiye, ajeh chu nangman nathil bol banga, keiman nangma insunga konna nadou ding thilse kahin kondoh sah ding ahi. chule namitmu changtah a najite jeng jong kalahpeh a naheng nakom mite kapeh doh ding, chule ama hon japi mitmu lai jenga jong najite chu aluppi dingu ahi. \x + \xo 12:11 \xt 2 Samuel 16:22\x*  
\v 12 Ijeh inem itileh nangman na thilbol chu guhthim'a nabol ahin, keiman vang Israel chate pumpi mitmu dinga kabol ding ahi,’ tin aseiye.”   
\s1 David In Achonset Aphon  
\p
\v 13 Chutah chun David in jong Nathan kom'a hitin aseiye, “Keima Pakai dounan kachonse tai,” atin ahileh; Nathan jong chun David kom'a asei paiyin, “Pakaijin na chonset angaidam tai. Hijeh a chu hiche chonset jeh in nangma thi tapon nate.  
\v 14 Hijongleh nangin hiche thil hi nabol a Pakai chu nahsahmo tah a nabol a nataitom ahitan, hijeh a chu ahung peng ding nacha chu thi tei-tei ding ahitai,” tin aseitai.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Nathan a inlam'a achejou chun Pakaijin Uriah jinu hin David chapa chu gotna apen ahileh naosen chu apet-pet in adammo paitan ahi.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun David jong naosen adamna din Pakai henga atao-tao tan ahi; David chun an angolin apotdoh in, jan khovah hel chun tollhanga alumin ahi.  
\v 17 Chuphat in a insung mi upa chengsen ajol-jol jeng uvin chule tollhanga alupnaa konna thodoh sah tei din agouve; ahinla David chu akithou doh dehpon, chule an jong ane dehpoi.   
\p
\v 18 Ahivangin nisagi lhin nin naosen chu athi tan ahi. Hichun naosen chu athitai tia David kom'a seipeh ding asohte chu akicha tauve; ajeh chu amaho geldol'a, vetan, naosen ahin laiya bon eiho thusei angai louva ahileh, tua naosen athitai, tia iti iseidoh ngam diu ham? Ama le ama kithalo mai ding ahi,” tia angaitou ahiye.   
\p
\v 19 Ahin David chun asohte chu akhoisa cheh tauve ti ahetdoh phat in naosen chu athi ahitai tin David in ahedoh pai paitan ahi; hijeh chun David chun asohte chu adongin, “Naosen chu athia hitam?” ati.  
\p Ama hon jong, “Heng'e, ama chu athitai,’ atiuve.   
\p
\v 20 Chuphat in David jong tol'a alupna a kon'in ahung thoudoh in akisil ngimin, thao akinun, aponsil akhel’in, Pakai Hou-In sunga avahlut in chibai agaboh e; chujouvin David chu ama inlama ahungin an athum in ama hon jong ankong aluipeh uva ahileh, an anetan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun asohten ajah a, “Ipi bola hitia hi naum ham? Naosen ahai-hai pet in an na ngol'in nakap-kap jengin, naosen athi tahbah phat in na thoudoh in an nane jenge,’ atiuve.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun David in jong, “Naosen ahinpet a chu an kangol'a ka ka-ka ahin, kon ija ahet thei ham, ajo le Pakaijin eilungset a naosen hi ahin hinsah thei ahi, tia keiman kagel jeh ahi.  
\v 23 Ahin tunvang ama athia ahitan ibola an kangol ngol nahlai ding ham? Ken ama chu kahinsah theiya nabol uham? Kei bou ama kom'a nikhat le kache ding ahin, ama chu kaheng'a hung kile kit louhel ding ahitai,” tin adonbut uve.   
\p
\v 24 Hichun David in ajinu Bathsheba alhem lungmongin akom'a agalut kit in aluppin ahileh amanun nao ahin vop in chapa khat ahing kit e, chule David in amin Solomon asah in ahi. Pakaijin ama hi angailui.  
\v 25 Hijeh chun Nathan themgaopa henga ahin hetsah in ahileh Nathan'in Pakai thusei dungjuijin ama chu amin Jedidiah tinjong aminvo kit e, (hichu “Pakaijin angailut” tina ahi).   
\s1 David In Rabbah Kho Alah  
\p
\v 26 Chuin Joab chun Ammon mite khopi lailung Rabbah chu adel khumin gal’in akisat pin ahileh ajouvin leng khopi chu alatan ahi.  
\v 27 Chuin Joab chun David kom'a sottolle miho asol’in agasei sah tai, “Keiman Rabbah kaga kisat pin, twiphai khopi chu kajoutai,” ati.  
\v 28 Hijeh chun tun mipi amoh cheng khomtup inlang khopi dounan ngahmun hung sem tan, chule akhopi jong hung toupha jengin, achuti louva ahileh keiman akhopi hi kalah a keima min kaputsah ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Hijeh chun David in mipi abonchan akhom sohkeijin Rabbah khopi lama achen, chule akhopi dounan gal abol’in akisat pin ahileh ajouvin akhopi chu alatan ahi.  
\v 30 Chule alengpau lallukhuh chu David in aluchanga kon'in alahdoh peh in chule ama luchang'ah akikoi tan ahi. Alallukhuh chu sana le songmantam a kisem chule agih dan chu pound somsagi le nga ahi. Chujongleh asunga chun song mantam tah akikoijin ahi. Chujongleh David chun Rabbah khopia thil thang tamtah ahin chom doh in ahi.  
\v 31 Chujongleh akhopi sunga cheng mipi jouse chu gal hingin akaiyin, chule thing-at ding leh tuphul kheng ding leh, heicha kheng dingin agoiyin, chule cheh dengin apansah tai. Hiti chun David chun hitobanga hi Ammon mite khopi jouse anabol ahi; chujouvin David le mipi chu abonchauvin Jerusalem'a ahung kile kit tauvin ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 Amnon In Tamar Ajonpi  
\p
\v 1 Chuin David chapa Absalom chun sopi numei hoitah khat aneijin, amin chu Tamar akiti. Chule Amnon chu Tamar ding'a asopi pa ahin, amapa chun adeicha lheh tan ahi.  
\v 2 Amnon chun Tamar chu adeichat behseh jeh in adammo lotan ahi; ijeh inem itileh Tamar chu nungah thengsel ahina laiyin, chule Amnon in amanu chu kachan joulou ding hitam tin alungin agel tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahivangin Amnon hin kiloipi gol lungthim suhtohje themtah khat aneijin, amin jong Jonadab akiti; amapa hi David loipa Shimea chapa ahi.  
\v 4 Nikhat Jonadab in Amnon kom'ah, “Ipi bola lengpa chapa jingkah seh le mingol ho um banga um jing nahim? Ipi ham naboina?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Amnon in jong aseipeh tai, “Keiman kasopi pa Absalom naonu Tamar khu ka deichat jeh ahi,” tin aphong doh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Chuphat in Jonadab chun, “Aphai, keiman ipi nabol ding na seipeh nange. Nungchen lang nalupna a khun lumin lang kinat lhem sah in. Napa chu nangma ve dinga ahung tengleh napa kom'a hitin seiyin, Tamar chu ahunga nangma dia anneh themkhat nahung bolpeh din thum'in. Chule aman namitmu a akhut tah a nahung vah a ahileh nangma naol chom din jong seipeh tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Amnon in jong asei bang bang chun alupna a alumin akinat lhem sah tai. Chuin lengpa chu ave din ahungtan ahileh Amnon chun lengpa kom'a chun aseitai, “Lungset tah in kanaonu Tamar chu neihin solpeh inlang keima mitmun kadutah khat neh ding eihung sempeh hen, chutile ken ama khutsoh mong-mong chu nenge,” ati tai.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun David jong anom in Tamar chu Amnon in a agache a anneh ding them khat agasem peh din asol tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Chuphat in Tamar jong Amnon in'a achen alhun phat in, alupna langa achelut tai. Hichun changbong goina alan changbong agoiyin, Amnon mitmu tah in changlhah chu asem’in akanpeh tai.  
\v 9 Ahin amanun akhangbel sunga a changlhah kansa chu Amnon angsunga agathah lutpeh vang'in amapan ane deh tapon ahi. Hichun Amnon’in asohte kom'ah aseijin, “Kakom'a kon'in nabon'un potdoh un,” ati. Hijeh chun abonchauvin ama kom'a kon'in apotdoh sohkei tauve.   
\p
\v 10 Chutah chun Amnon in Tamar kom'a asei in, “Tun anneh ding chu kalupna langah hinchoilut inlang chule nei nehsah tan,” ati. Hichun Tamar injong anneh ding chu achoilut peh tan ahi.  
\v 11 Ahin amanun anehsah jing lai chun, amapan ahin tuhchah kheh in chule athum tan ahi, “Hungin neihung luppin kalungset kanaonu,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Chuin Tamar chu akap in “Ahipoi, he-u!, ngol hih in! hitobang pihi keima kom'ah bol hihbeh in! Hitobang ngol hoitah thil hi Israel chate lah a kibol ngailou ahi.  
\v 13 Chule keiman hoilam a jum kathoh ngam ding ham? Chule nang jong Israel chate lah a michavai mingol khat mong-mong nahi ding hita chume. Hijeh a chu katao tho ahi, lengpa kom'a nei kithum lechun aman jong nang ding beh a chu ajahda louhel ding ahinai,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Ahin Amnon chun amanu thusei chu angaipeh tapon, amanu sanga athahat joh jeh chun pumhat in aluppi tai.  
\v 15 Chuin hetman louvin Amnon lungsetna chu mudana joh ahungsoh tan, chule amuda dan chu masanga adeichatna sang'in akhoh jotan ahi. Hijeh chun Amnon chun akom'a hitin aseitai, “Kithoudoh loiyin lang potdoh loiyin,” tin asoldoh loitan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Chuin Tamar in kap pumin aseijin, “Ahipoi he-u! Hitobang thildih louva neisol doh loi hi neibol masatna sanga khoh cheh jo ahi,” ativangin Amnon in angai peh deh tapon ahi.  
\v 17 Chujouvin Amnon in alhacha ho akouvin thu apetan ahi, “Hiche nu hi kamasang a kon'in soldoh loiyun lang anunga kotpi chu kamloi un!” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Hiti chun Amnon lhacha hon Tamar chu asoldoh loiyun anunga kotpi akamden tan ahi. Tamar chun sangkhol chol hoitah aki-ah ahi; ajeh chu chuche lai khanga chonna dan dungjui a leng chanu nungahtheng ho chu hitobanga chu ana kivonji mongu ahiye.  
\v 19 Ahinlah tun Tamar in asang khol chol chu abottel’in chule alujang'ah vutvam akiloi tan ahi. Chuin akhut chu amai ah akoi in, othongje jun akap in achemang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun a-upa Absalom in ana dongin “Na sopipa Amnon chun naum khompi hiteiyin te ong? Hijongleh tun thipchet in umtan, ajeh chu ama jong na upa ahi bouve. Chule athilbol hi nalungthim a chinda tan,” ati. Hijeh chun Tamar jong a upa Absalom in’a chun lung genthei tah in acheng den tan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin David lengpan hitobang thilsoh ho hi ajahdoh phat in alunghang lheh jeng tan ahi.  
\v 22 Chule Absalom in hitobang thilsoh hi Amnon kom'a aseidoh lou vang'in Amnon chu nasatah in avetda lheh jeng tan ahi ajeh chu anaonu chunga athilbol aum chan jeh chu ahi.   
\s1 Absalom in Amnon Chunga Phu Alah  
\p
\v 23 Hiti chun kumni jouvin Absalom chun Ephriam kom'a Baal-hazor khoa kelngoi mul avou in, Chule Absalom chun leng chapa te jouse chu abonchan golvah a chun akou sohkei in ahi.  
\v 24 Hichun Absalom jong lengpa henga achen hitin agaseiye, “Ka kelngoimul vou hon tun na atongun, hijeh chun lengpa le asoh te jouse jong lungset tah a nahung uva hiche nikho hi keitoh neihung man khompi diu ham? tin agaseitai.   
\p
\v 25 Ahivangin lengpan Absalom adonbut in, “Ahipoi kacha, kabon uva kahung uleh nang dinga khanlel kahi diu ahi,” ati. Ahinla Absalom in aha tem cheh jengin, Absalom chu aphattheina aboh jeng vang'in David chu ache dehpoi.   
\p
\v 26 Chuphat in Absalom'in, “Aphai, khutia nang nahung thei louding leh iti nagel em kanaopa Amnon hinsol ding chu?” ati. Chuin lengpan ahin donbut in,  
\p “Ipi jeh a Amnon hung ding?” ati.  
\v 27 Ahin Absalomin aseikit in Amnon le leng chapa te aboncha solpeh ding lengpa anop masang'in angeh-ngeh jeng tan ahi. Ajeh chu Absalom kigotna hi lengte jaona dia kilomtah a kin agon ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Chujou in Absalom chun asoh te chu thu aseipeh masat in, “Amnon chu lengpitwi ahung kham ve-lhi jing jeng uvin lang, keiman najah-uva, ‘Amnon chu jep uvin tia kahin sei tengleh that jeng uvin, kicha hih hel’uvin. Ajeh chu keiman thu kapeh louva nabol u ham? Hangsan tah le thaneitah in pang uvin,” tin aseipeh tai.  
\v 29 Hijeh chun Absalom sohten jong Absalom in athupeh bang-bang uvin Amnon chu athat tauvin ahi. Chuin lengpa chapa te adang ho se abonchan akipat uvin asakol pol cheh chunga atoudoh sohkei uvin ajam gam tauve.   
\p
\v 30 Hichun amaho Jerusalem ahung akile uvin, David henga thu ahung kithang lut masan: “Absalom'in lengpa chapa te jouse athat gam e, khat a khat cha jong ahing hoi tapoi!” tin ahung kisei e.  
\v 31 Chutah chun lengpa jong akipatdoh paiyin aponsil jouse abottel’in tollhanga akijam tai; chuin akom'a ding alhacha jousen jong tijat jeh le lungkham jeh in aponsil akibotel sohkei tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Chuin David golpa Shimea chapa Jonadab chu David kom'a ahungin hitin aseije, “Ahipoi tahsan hihbeh in, lengpa chapa te ho jouse aboncha atha ahi sampoi, Amnon chang seh kithat ahi bouve; ijeh-inem itileh Absalom'in hiche bol ding hi masanga pat Amnon'in anaonu Tamar pumhat san a abolset nikhoa pat a chu gonsa anakoi ahitai.  
\v 33 Ahipoi, kapu lengpa na chapa te abonchauva thigam ahipoi! Amnon sehbou thi ahi,” ati.  
\v 34 Hiche phat tah chun Absalom chu ajammang tai.  
\p Chuin Jerusalem a mive lhia pangpa chu akhodah in agah vet a ahileh, “Vetan, Horonaim molsang pang langa chun mihem tamtah ahung kijot kamui,” tin lengpa seipeh din alhai tan ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Hichun Jonadab chun lengpa jah ah, “Ven! Tun leng chapa te khu ahung tauve!; Na lhachapa keiman ka seipeh bangin ahung tauve,” ati peh e.   
\p
\v 36 Chule Jonadab chun thu asei jou jouvin, vetan, lengpa chapa te chu ahunglhung pai tauvin, chuin apeng jah uvin akap cheh tauvin ahileh, lengpa le alhacha ho jong abonchauvin lhase tah in akap sohkei uve.  
\v 37 Chuin David in nisotpi achapa Amnon pul adouvin ahi.  
\p Absalom vang chu apupa Geshur lengpa Ammihud chapa Talmai kom'a ajam tan ahi. \x + \xo 13:37 \xt 2 Samuel 3:3\x*  
\v 38 Hiti chun Absalom Geshur gam'ah kumthum sungin aga um tan ahi.  
\v 39 Chule tun leng David injong Amnon thi chung changa kichamna nei a, achapa Absalom toh kithah gopkhom kit ding chu angaicha lheh tan ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Absalom Kinungle Kitna Dinga Joab Tohgon  
\p
\v 1 Chuin lengpan Absalom hi angaicha lheh jeng tai ti Zeruiah chapa Joab hin ahin hetdoh tan ahi.  
\v 2 Joab hin mi asolin Tekoa khosunga mi numei chingtah khat aga holdoh sah in, amanu kom'a chun aseitai, “Nangma tun lunghem a puldou-dou jeng tobangin kisem in, pul douna ponsil kisil’inlang, thao jeng jong kinu dan, ajeh chu phat sottah sunga thi-op a um numei puldou jing bangin um'in.  
\v 3 Chutengleh lengpa kom'a ga chelut inlang, ajah a hitin gaseijin, atin Joab chun asei ding thu jouse abonchan amanu chu athumop tai.   
\p
\v 4 Tekoa khosunga numeinu chu lengpa kom'a ahung phat in abohkhup in tol'a amai asulut in jana apetai, chule aman aseijin, “Vo lengpa, nei panpin,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun lengpan jong adongin, “Na gentheina ipi pen ham?”  
\p atileh, amanun adonbut in, “O kaden, keima meithainu kahi, kajipa athia ahitai.  
\v 6 Chule nasohnu keihin chapa ni kaneijin, amani chu loujaova ahung kibao lhon'in akina lhone; hichun amani phel khen ding mihem khat cha ana umlou jeh in khatpan khatjoh pa chu ajep in athat pai tai.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun tun vetan, insung pumpi ahung kon uvin nasohnu hi eidel khum uvin hitin asei uve, asopipa that pa chu hin lhadoh loiyin, aman asopipa athat in ahinkho khel a keihon ama katha diu ahi,’ tin asei uve; hitobang hin ama hon ama chilhah jong asuhbei tei diu dol ahitai. Hitia hi ama hon keima mei-am jeng jong achen mit uva hiche leiset chunga kajipa min asuhmang diu, achikhai ding jong aumsah lou diu ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Chuphat in lengpan jong numei nu kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Keima boldin dalhan lang, na inlam a chen, keiman ana vesui tange, koiman atohkhah louna din,” tin asol tai.   
\p
\v 9 Chuin Tekoa khoa hung kon numeinu chun lengpa kom'a chun hitin aseikit e, “Kakipah e, kapu lengpa chule Kapu lengpa chu keima eikithopi jeh a nahin seiset khah uleh themmona chu keima le ka inkote chunga chujo hen, lengpa le alaltouna vang themmona beiyin umjo hen,” tin aseiye.   
\p
\v 10 Chuin lengpan aseikit in, “Mihem khat touvin nakom'a thu aseikit a ahileh ama chu kei kom'a hinpui jengin, ama chun nangma natham khah kit louhel ding ahi,” atipeh e.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun amanun jong aseikit in, “Lungset tah in Pakai na Pathen henga nei taopeh tei-teijin, chutia chu thisan phu lanom pan mi athakit louva, kachapa atha louna din,” atileh; lengpan jong aseipeh-in,  
\p “Pakai hingjing min'a kasei ahi, na chapa chu asamjang khat jeng cha jong kisubui louding ahi,” atitai.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun numei nun aseikit in, “Lungset tah-in nasohnu kei hi kapu lengpa kom'a thucheng khat beh nei seisah kit in,” atia ahileh;  
\p lengpan jong, “Seiyin seiyin,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun numei nun aseijin, “Chuti ahileh ipi dinga nangman Pathen mite douna a hitobang thilgon hi nanei ham? Ijeh-inem itileh lengpan hitobanga thutanna naneiya kon hin lengpan nadel mangpa inlama napuilut loujeh in na thutan hi nangma chung ma-ma a nakitan ahitai.  
\v 14 Ajeh chu eiho iboncha uva athi cheh ding ihiuve, chule iboncha uva tol'a twi kisunglha kinung thaldoh kit theilou tobang ihiuvin ahi. Pathen'in jong mithilong damsa chu phong doh kit deh taponte; chule lengpa chun ama toh ikikhan teng ule ama toh ihung umkhom thei kitna diu aneijin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 “Chule keima hiche thuseiya hi kapu lengpa henga hung kahi, ipi jeh-inem itileh mipi hin keima eitijat sah tauvin chuphat a nasohnu ken jong hitia hi kagel a, ‘Keiman lengpa kom'a gasei tange, ijem itileh lengpan asohnu kei thusei hi ngai jeng khat nante  
\v 16 chule lengpan jong eisumang ding miho khut a eihuhdoh tei ding ahi, Pathen mite lah a ei suhmang sah louding ahi.’  
\v 17 Henge, kapu lengpan lungthim chamna eihin peh kit diu ahi. Chule keiman kahen nangma hi thilpha thilse hekhen dol a Pathen vantil tobang nahi. Pakai na Pathen'in napanpi jing hen,” ati. \x + \xo 14:17 \xt 2 Samuel 19:27\x*   
\p
\v 18 Hichun lengpan jong numeinu chu adonbut in, “Keiman kadoh doh chu ipi hijongleh imlou helin neihin seipeh in,” ati.  
\p Hichun numei nun jong aseijin, “Kapu lengpan na seinom nom sei jengin,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun lengpan adongin, “Thil hijatpi naseina a hi nangma Joab chutoh kihoutoh a kikhut jop nahim?” atileh; numeinu jong chun adonbut in, “Kapu lengpa, iti ken kaseilep ding ham? Koima chan nangma kom'ah imacha sel thei ponte. “Henge, Joab in eihinsol a chule thu hijatpi hi aman nasohnu keima hi eithumop a ka kamsung'a eikhumpeh ahinai.  
\v 20 Na lhacha Joab chun nalung nakhel a thil kigon dol jouse nakhel doh ding gelkhoh na a hiche hi abol anahi. Ahoi chu hita leh kapu nangma hi leiset chunga um thil ijakai hetna dol a nachih dan mong-mong Pathen Vantil chihna tobang bang ahi bouve!” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Chutah chun lengpan jong Joab kom'a aseijin asol tan ahi, “Aphai, tun chen lang gollhangpa Absalom chu ganung puilut tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Chuin Joab jong chu tol'a abohkhup in, jana apen, lengpa phatthei aboh in, hiti hin Joab chun aseitai, “Tuni hin kapu lengpa mitmun lungset na kachang mong-mong e, nasoh pa thil ngeh khoh pen hi nanop peh jenge,’ ati.   
\p
\v 23 Chuin Joab jong akipat doh paiyin Geshur gam'a achen Absalom chu Jerusalem a ahin lepui tai.  
\v 24 Ahin lengpan hitin thupeh aneiye, “Absalom hi ama insunga che maithei ahi, ahin keima angsunga vang hung vahlut thei louhel ding ahi,” ati. Hijeh chun Absalom in lengpa chu amu tapon ahi.   
\s1 David Le Absalom Kicham  
\p
\v 25 Tun Israel chate lah a Absalom tobanga amel-hoi jeh a seiphat thei dang koimacha ana umpoi; Absalom hi akeng khotaljum apat alujang geiya achunga nolna ding beihel ahi.  
\v 26 Alujang sam chu kumkhat a khatvei bou acheji ahi chule ajeh chu agih behseh jijeh ahi. Hitia hi asam akivoa thil tenaa atea ahileh, asam jeng jong chu pound nga cheng agih jin ahi.  
\v 27 Absalom hin chapa thum ahingin, chule chanu khat jong ahingin, achanu min chu Tamar akiti; Tamar jong hi numei hoi tah khatma ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Hiti hin Absalom hi kum ni lhingset Jerusalem'a cheng ahin, hijongleh lengpa angsung'ah khatvei cha avahlut kha hihbeh in ahi.  
\v 29 Chuin Absalom chun Joab kou dingin mi asol’in, ahunga ahileh lengpa kom'a sol din agon; ahinla Joab chu Absalom kom'a ahung tapon ahi. Hichun Joab in mi asol kit in, ahi vang'in Joab chu ahung deh kitpoi.  
\v 30 Chuphat in aman jong asohte kom'a asei in, “Veuvin, Joab lou khu keima lou ban tah ahin, cheuvin lang alou khu meijin gahalvam tauvin,” ati. Hijeh chun Absalom soh ten jong Joab lou chu meiyin agahalvam tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Chuphat in Joab jong akipat doh in Absalom kom'a achen akom'a hitin aseiye, “Ipi dinga nasoh ten kalou meiya ahalvam jengu hitam?” agati.   
\p
\v 32 Hichun Absalom jong chun Joab chu adonbut in, “Ajehchu lengpan ipi ding pen tah a keima hi Geshur gam'a konna hung khoh-khoh a kahiya, kei dinga Geshur gam'a umden chu nomjo dinga?” tin aseiye, tia gadoh sah ding kati nahi. Tujengin jong lengpa angsunga nei lutsah mong-mong inlang keiman themmona kaneiya ahijongleh aman eithat jeng hen, ati tia gasei sah ding kati nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 33 Hijeh chun Joab jong lengpa kom'a achen aga seipeh tan ahileh, hichun lengpan jong Absalom chu akoutai. Chuin Absalom jong lengpa kom'a ahungin, lengpa angsunga chun abohkhup in amai tol'a asulut in jana apen ahi; chuin lengpan jong Absalom chu achop tai.   
\c 15  
\s1 Absalom Phatlouna  
\p
\v 1 Hiti ho jouse kichai nung hin, Absalom chun kangtalai khat akisem’in, sakol akai ding ho jong akigot toh sohkeiyin, chule amasanga lhaidin pasal cheh mi som nga akilhen doh tai.  
\v 2 Absalom hi jingkah seh jingpi tah in athou jin, kelkot lampi geiya chun ading jin ahi; hiti chun mihem khat tou lengpa kom'a mi hehna ding thu aneiya, athu tan sah ding ahung tengleh, hitobang miho chu Absalom'in akoujin ana dong ji'e, “Hoilai khopi pen a konna hung nahim?” tia adoh le mihem pan jong, aphung min aseipeh ding ahi.  
\v 3 Hiteng chule Absalom in aseipeh kitjin, “Nangman thu nasatah nahin polut e! Chule hiche hi aphamo lheh jenge lengpan hichu ngai din koima aneipon ahi.  
\v 4 Chujongleh Absalom chun aseikit in, “O kadeh, keima hi gamsunga thutan vaihom a pang ana hileng, mijousen achungthu u keikom'a tan dia ahin pohlut diu, chule keiman thudihtah a katan peh diu ahi!” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hitia chu ama angsunga bohkhup dia mi ahung tengleh Absalom chu anomji pon hisang chun aman hitobang miho chu akhut in atuh chah jeng jin, achop jin ahi.  
\v 6 Hitobang hin lengpa kom'a athu kikhol a kitan sah dinga hungji Israel mi tapou chu Absalom'in anabol jing jin ahi; hiche a kon hin Absalom in Israel mipi jouse lungthim abonchan athunun sohhel tai.   
\p
\v 7 Chule kumli alhin jouvin Absalom in lengpa kom'a chun aseijin, “Lungset tah in neisol inlang keima Hebron khopia khun cheng ting Pakaiya kilhaina gasem ingting chule keiman ama toh kitepna kasem chu gabulhit tange, ati..  
\v 8 Ijeh-inem itileh na lhachapa keima Geshur gamsung Aram a kachen lai chun kitepna khat kanabol’in hitin kana seiye, ‘Pakaijin Jerusalem'a einung puilut kit pou-pouva ahileh keiman Pakai kom'a kilhaina kabol'a chibai kaboh ding ahi,’ tin kana seiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun lengpan jong aseipeh in,“Aphai, chenlang nakitepna chu gamolso tan,” ati. Hijeh chun Absalom jong akipatdoh paijin Hebron achetai.  
\v 10 Ahinla Absalom chun guhthim chan Israel phung jouse kom'a sottolle miho ana sol'a hitia hi ana seisa ahi, “Nanghon saki pengkul kimut ging najah pou-pou uva ahileh, ‘Hebron khopia Absalom aleng chang tai,’ tia nasei diu ahi,” tin ana hil masa tan ahi.  
\v 11 Mihem jani Jerusalem khopia kon'in Absalom chutoh akilhon uvin, ahin amaho chun Absalom lunggel ngaito imacha ahepouvin ahi.  
\v 12 Absalom'in kilhaina gantha ima abol laiyin, Giloh mi Ahithophel kitipa, David dinga lungthima kithopi phatah mipa chun mi asol’in achenna Giloh khopia kon'in aga kousah tai. Chule Absalom in thilse abol'a lengpa adouna chu akhang tul-tul jengin, mipin jong Absalom ajop be-be jeng tauve.   
\s1 Jerusalem Akon David Akiseldoh  
\p
\v 13 Hijeh chun sottolle mi khat chu David kom'a ahungin hitin ahung seiye, “Israel miten alungthim uvin Absalom nung ajui gam tauve,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Chuphat in David jong chun Jerusalem khopia aumkhompi amite hengah hitin aseitai, “Khatvei jam a ibonchauva ijam diu ahitai, akhuti louleh ivaigei diu ahitai. Kino loi ute! Absalom ahung lhun masanga khopi sunga kon ipotdoh ule, eiho ihiuvin chule Jerusalem khopi sung jong toset akon hoidoh thei ding ahi, ati.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun David lengpa kithopi hon jong ama chu adonbut un, keiho nangma toh kaum jing nauve, hijeh chun nangman aphapen ahi tia nagel chu bol tan atiuve.   
\p
\v 16 Hijeh chun lengpa jong akipatdoh pai paiyin a insung mite jouse jong anunga akitol tauve. Chule lengpan in ngah dinga thaikem numei som adalhah tilou koimacha adalha pon ahi.  
\v 17 Hitia lengpa apotdoh jeng phat in mipin anung ajui cheh tauvin ahi; acheu chun khopi ning langa veng pam nunung pentah a in khat a aki ngauvin ahi.  
\v 18 Chule lengpa lhacha ho jousen ama akhel sohkei uvin ahi. Gath khoa kipat a David nung hinjui ho chu mi 600 ahiuvin amaho cheng chu lengpa vengbit a umho toh hung kilhon ahiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 David lengpa chu akihei in Gath mite lah a lamkai Ittai kom achun asei tan ahi, “Ipi dinga nangma keiho to nakilhon ham? Chule nangma kinunglen lang Absalom lengpa kom gaum tan, ajeh chu nangma gamchom mi nahin, among monga jong na ina konna hikom'a sohchanga hung khopem nahi bouve.  
\v 20 Chujongleh nangma janhia hunglhung bep a hoilam kajot ding chule hoilam a kache ding bon kihe louva iti tunia ken nangma keiho banga ka genthei sah ding ham? Kile kittan, chule nasoh teu kipuiyin lang kile kit mong-mong tan; chule Pakaijin ami ngailutna le akitahna na musah jing hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Ahinla Ittai chun lengpa chu adonbut in, “Pakai hingjing min le kapu lengpa hinlai pet a kasei ahi, kapu lengpa chuh chuhna a thina ding mun hihen, hinna ding mun hijongleh, nache chena a chu nasohpa kei jong kahung jeng ding ahi bouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Chuphat in David jong chun adonbut in, “Akhuti le aphai hungun chekhom ute,” atileh Ittai jong ache masan, amite chengse le akilhonpi nunao chapang jouse chutoh akitol tauve.   
\p
\v 23 Mipi chutia akitol jeng phat uvin gamsung pumpi chu othong jejun akap tauve; chule lengpa jong achen Kidron lui agalkai tai, hiti hin mipi abonchauvin gamsung lam jonin akitoldoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Chule Zadok jong Levi te se-se jong ahiuvin, Pathen Kitepna Thingkhong chu ahinpu uvin ahi; chuin mipi aboncha khopi akhokhel kah seuvin Abiathar in jong Pathen hengah kilhaina abollin Pathen Thingkhong chu tol'a angauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun lengpan jong Zadok kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Pathen Thingkhong hi khopi sunga polut kit tan. Ajeh chu Pakayin avet a eilungset a ahileh eihin puikit intin, hiche Thingkhong le achenna mun hi eimusah kit tei-tei ding ahi.  
\v 26 Amavang Pakaijin, ‘Nachunga kalung alhaipoi,’ tia aseiya ahileh, keima hikom'a kaum jinge, aman aphatsah lam-lamin eibol jeng hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Chule lengpan Zadok thempupa kom'a hitin jong aseiye, “Ven, hiche hi kalungtup ahi. Nang le Abiathar chule na chapa teni lhon Ahimaaz le Abiathar chapa Jonathan chutoh thipchet in khopi lam kinungle tauvin.  
\v 28 Chule keima Jordan vadunga kana kingah ding nang hon thu neihung hetsah kah seuva kana nga-nga jeng ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 29 Hijeh chun Zadok le Abiathar chun Pathen Thingkhong chu Jerusalem khopi sunga anung pohlut kit lhon'in, chule khopi sunga aumden lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 30 Ahin David vang chu Olive thinglhang vum lama akaltou in, alamjot pum pumin akap peh jengin, chule akeng keovin lam ajot in, ponlu akikhuh in ahi. Chujongleh akilhonpi mipi jong chun abonchauvin ponlu akikhuh sohkeiyun, akitol tou paiyun, chule mipi jouse jong chun kap pum pumin lam ajot un ahi.  
\v 31 Hichun mihon David kom'a thuguh ahung seipeh un hitin asei uve, “Ahithophel jong lengpa doumah bol miho lah a apangin, chule Absalom toh aki thokhom e,” ahung tipeh uve. Chuphat in David jong chun hitin aseiye, “Vo Pakai, Ahithophel lungthim ngaito jouse chu ngolnan heidoh peh tan, tia katao ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Hichun Pathen kihouna mun molvum asang lai a chu David ahung kaldoh phat in vetan, David golpa Arka mi Hushai kitipa chu a sangkhol chol kibottel san alujang a leivui akinun David lamto din ahung e.  
\v 33 Hichun David jong chun Hushai kom'a hitin aseiye, “Nangman nei kilhonpi le chun kei dinga nohphah sah hibep ding ahi.  
\v 34 Chusangin nangma Jerusalem khopi sunga lut inlang Absalom kom'a chun, ‘Vo lengpa, masang laiya napa lhacha a kapan bang chun, tunjong keima hi nangma lhachan nei pansah tan,’ gatin; chuti chun pang thei lechun nangman Ahithophel kitipa lunggel ngaito chu nasuh lhah thei ding ahi.  
\v 35 Khosunga khu Zadok le Abiathar thempu teni chun nangma napanpi loudinga nagel ham? Hiti hin gabol inlang, ipi pi hijongleh nangman lengpa insunga kaseidoh najah chan chu Zadok le Abiathar thempu teni kom'a hin seisonji jin ati.  
\v 36 Chule ipipi thil um hitam ti hetna dia chu achapa teni lhon Ahimaaz le Jonathan chu ahinsol ji-ji lhon ding ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Hijeh chun David golpa Hushai chu Abalom Jerusalem khopi sunga ahung lut pet tah chun ama jong khopi sunga ahung lut in ahi.   
\c 16  
\s1 David Le Ziba  
\p
\v 1 Hichun David in molsang ijat hamkhat alep nungin Mephibosheth sohpa Ziba in Sangan ni apot poh ding to kikansa le changlhah pheng 200, lengpi theiga boh 100, nipi lai theiga jat 100, chule lengpitwi savun bom dim set khat toh ana lamton ahi. \x + \xo 16:1 \xt 2 Samuel 9:9,10\x*   
\p
\v 2 Hichun David lengpan Ziba chu hitin ana dongin, “Ipi dinga thil hijatpi hi nahin poh hitam?” atileh;  
\p Ziban jong adonbut in, “Sangan teni hi lengpa insung mite touna ding ahin, chule changlhah le nipi lai theiga hi sepai te neh ding ahin; chutengleh lengpitwi hi gamthip laiya dangchah a thachol ho don ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Chuphat in David lengpan adongpai in, “Napu tupa Mephibosheth chu hoiya ba um hitam?” atia ahileh; Ziba'n lengpa kom'a chun hitin asei e, “Vetan, ama chu tuni geijin Jerusalem'a aum jing nalaiye, chule keiman tunia hi kapupa Saul lenggam chu kale lah ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 16:3 \xt 2 Samuel 19:25-27\x*   
\p
\v 4 Chuin Ziba kom'a chun lengpan aseikit in, “Ven, Mephibosheth thil le lo jouse chu aboncha tua hi nang na chan ding ahitai,” atipeh e.  
\p Chutah chun Ziba'n jong asei pai jengin, “Keiman nang kaja bol nahi, neimu chanin kachunga lunglhai jing jengin, kapu lengpa,” ati.   
\s1 Shimei In David Agaosap  
\p
\v 5 Chule David chun Bahurim kho ahin phah phat in Saul insungmi pasal khat ahung potdoh in, ama chu amin Shimei ahin, Gera chapa ahi; ahung potdoh in alamjot toh gaosap ahinkop in ahi.  
\v 6 Chujongleh song alan David ahin, asepai jalamte ahin, chule ajet avei a mihat kigol ho jouse jong chu songin asep tan ahi.  
\v 7 Hiti chun ami gaosap pum-pum'in Shimei chun asei in, “Chemang loiyin, chemang loiyin nangma thisanso hat le hindan helou mi nahi tin David henglam a chun asam tan ahi.  
\v 8 Pakaijin Saul insung mite thisan chu na chunga ahinle lhunsah ahitai. Nangman ama lenggam chu na-na guh ahin, chule tua hi Pakaijin nachapa Absalom khut a apehdoh ahitai. Nangma thisan sohat nahijeh a , na themmona chu nachung ma-ma chu ahitai!” ati   
\p
\v 9 Chuphat in Zeruiah chapa Abishai chun lengpa kom'a hitin asei e, “Ipi dinga hiche uithisa hin kapu lengpa hitia agao sap-sap jeng ham? Neisol inlang alol gatan inge,” atileh;   
\p
\v 10 Lengpan jong aphoh in, “Zeruiah chapa te nangho kon nadoh beh uvem! Pakaijin ajah a aseipeh a kei hi gaosap in atileh, nang koi nahija ama chu nakham ding ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Chujongleh David chun Abishai le asohte jouse kom'a hitin asei e, “Vetan, keima chapa mong-mong in bon tha dinga eihol'a ahileh, hiche Saul sopipa hin iti abolda thei ding ham! Hijeh chun don dauvin lang gaosap sah-sah jeng tauvin; ajeh chu Pakaijin bollin tia aseipeh ahi.  
\v 12 Ijem itileh Pakaijin ka genthei hesohna hi eivet peh in tin, tunia eiki gaosapna jeh a Pakaijin keima dinga thilpha eibol peh thei joh ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 13 Chuti chun David le amite chu lampia achepeh uvin, Shimei jong chu David chutoh kigal mupeh in thinglhang jui juiya ache peh in agaosap sap jeng e; chule amaho chun David chu song le lei vui in jong asep uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin David lengpa le alhonpi mipi ho chu abonchauvin athachol lheh tauvin hichun Jordan vadung agei un abon uvin akichol un ahi.   
\s1 Ahithophel In Absalom Ahil  
\p
\v 15 Chutah chun Absalom le Israel mite jouse jong chu Jerusalem a ahung uvin, Ahithophel kitipa chun Absalom ahin lhon pin ahi.  
\v 16 Chuin David golpa Hushai Arka mipa chu ahung lhun lhunin Absalom kom'a ache paijin, ‘Hingsot in lengpa, lengpa hingsot in! tin ahin sam tai.   
\p
\v 17 Chutah chun Absalom in jong Hushai kom'a chun hitin asei e, “Hitia hi na golpa David chu nabol mong ding ham? Iti dan a ama toh ding khom lou nahim?” tin adong tai.   
\p
\v 18 Ahin Hushai chun Absalom kom'a asei kit in, “Ahipoi, koi-koi hijeng jongleh Pakai le hiche Israel miten abonchauva alhen doh pen-pen chu kei jong ama a chu kahi jengin, ama chutoh keima kalhat khom jing ding ahi bouve,” ati.  
\v 19 “Chujongleh keiman koi dang kin kabol ding ham? Lengpa chapa kin bol'a kapan tei-tei ding hilou ham? Keiman napa na kana toh bang-bang a tua nangma na jong katoh ding ahi,” atitai.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Absalom chun Ahithophel adongin, “Nalung gel temin, ipi aban kabol ding hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Ahithophel jong chun Absalom aseipeh in, “Napan in ngah dinga adalhah athaikem ho kom'a khun galut inlang galup pin; chutileh Israel pumpin nangma hi napa doumah lamtah a kisa nahitai, ti hin jadoh uvin tin, chutile ama hon nangma nahin jop sohkei diu ahi,” atipeh e.  
\v 22 Hichun mihon Absalom dingin inchungah ponbuh ason peh un, chuin Absalom chu Israel mite pumpi mitmu laitah in apa thaikem ho kom'a alut jengin aluppi tan ahi. \x + \xo 16:22 \xt 2 Samuel 12:11,12\x*   
\p
\v 23 Hiche lai a Ahithophel kitipan mi athumop tapou chu Pathen kamcheng tah a hungsoh banga ana gel u ahi hitobang jeh a hi Absalom in Ahithophel thumop chu David in anabol banga anajui ahi.   
\c 17  
\p
\v 1 Tun Ahithophel in Absalom kom'a hitin angeh tan ahi, “Tujan ma-ma David nung del pai din keiman Sepai 12,000 kilhen doh inge.  
\v 2 Keiman David chu athachol pet tah le akingaiset pet tah a kaga mat ding ahi. Chule ama le a sepai te jouse kasuh kichat ding chuteng mijouse jammang soh ding chuteng keiman lengpa bou katha ding ahi.  
\v 3 Mipi ho vang chu abonchauva kahin puilut ding, mou thah akichenpi ding pa henga hung kipuilut banga inlam a kahin puilut ding ahi bouve; chule nangman mikhat seh bou tha dinga nahol ahin, chutengleh mipi vang chu lungmong tah a um diu ahitai,” ati.  
\v 4 Athusei hin Absalom alunglhai sah lheh jengin, chule Israel chunga lamkai ho jouse jong abonchauvin alung lhaisah sohhel tan ahi.   
\s1 Hushai In Ahithophel Thumop Akimaitopi  
\p
\v 5 Chuphat in Absalom chun hitin aseiye, “Arka mi Hushai chu hin puilut uvin, aman ipi agel a asei em, ngai uhite,” ati.  
\v 6 Hichun Hushai chu Absalom kom ahin puilut tauvin chuin Absalom'in Ahithophel thusei chu Hushai aseipeh tan ahi. Chuin aman adongin, nangma lunggel ipi ham? Hinsei in ahilouleh Ahithophel thumop hi ijui jing diu hitam? Ahilouleh ipi na thumop nom em?” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hijeh chun Hushai jong chun Absalom kom'a chun asei paiyin, “Tuchunga Ahithophel mihilna hi thilpha ahipoi,” ati tai.  
\v 8 Hichun Hushai chun aseibe kit nalai e, “Napa ahin amite ahiuvin mihat ahi, ti nangman jong na hetsa ahi; chujongleh amaho hi akiphin lunghangsa ahiuvin, gamlah a anou kilahpeh savompi tobang ahiuve. Hiche tilou jong hin napa chu galbol them tah mi ana hikit e. Hijeh chun ama hi mipi ho toh geh khom louhel ding ahi, ati.  
\v 9 Tu jenga jong achang seh a kokhuh dung khat a kisel ham, ahilouleh mun chom dang khat a kisel ding ahitai. Chule ama ahungdoh a nahin bulu tengu leh na mite themkhat chu hung thi tei ding, chuteng na sepai te chunga tijatna le kichatna hunglhung ding, chule hitia hi Absalom mite chu akithat tai tia thu hung kithang ding ahi.  
\v 10 Chutengleh gal-hang miho lungput sakei bahkai lungput tobang jeng ho jong chu kicha a hung lung lhadai gam diu ahi; ajeh chu napa chu mihat tah ahin, apanpi miho jong chu gal-hang mi jeng ahiuve, tihi Israel pumpin ahin hetdoh ding ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hijongleh keima lunggel vang ahileh, Israel chate pumpi hi sahlam Dan gam apat lhanglam Beersheba geijin nangma kom'a hung kikhom sohkei uhen lang, twikhanglen panga neldi jat aphah teng uleh nangma tah in mijouse chu lamkai lechun kati ahi.  
\v 12 Chuti henlang hileh eihon David chu imuteng uleh achunga ichuh cheh uva, tol'a daitwi alhah bang banga achunga ikibuh lhah cheh diu ahi. Khuti henlang hile ama ahin apanpi miho jouse puma khat a khat jeng cha jong ahingdoh umlou diu ahi.  
\v 13 Chule ijem tin David chu khosung dung khat a jamlut jongleh, Israel pumpin khao kipat sohkeijin tin, chule akhopi chu kikai manghel intin, song halsi khat geiya jong kidalha louding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Chuphat in Absalom le Israel miten abonchauvin aseiyun, “Arka mi Hushai thumop hi Ahithophel thumop sangin aphajoi,” ati tauve. Ijeh-inem itileh Pakaijin Absalom chunga thilse aso sah nom jeh a Ahithophel lunggel phatah chu suh lhahna dinga tohgon ana neisa ahitan ahi.   
\s1 Hushai In David Kiseldoh Dia Aseipeh  
\p
\v 15 Hichun Hushai chun thempu teni Zadok le Abiathar chu aseipeh in, “Hitobang hin chule hiti hin Ahithophel chun Absalom le Israel upaho ahilchah tai; hichun keiman jong hitobang hin kahil guh kit in ahi, atitai.  
\v 16 Hijeh chun tun mi sol loi lhon'in lang David kom'a gasei sah lhon'in, ajeh chu ‘Tujan hin gamthip noi palmun dunga ana geh hihbeh in, iti nama jongleh ana galkai pai tei-teijin; achuti louva ahileh lengpa David le akilhonpi mite chu abonchauva min athagam hel diu ahitai,’ tin gasei sah lhon tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 17 Jonathan le Ahimaaz chun En-rogel mun a chu anga jing ji lhona, soh numei khat che a amani chu thu aga pehji ahi; chutengleh amani chepai kitji lhon a David lengpa aga seipeh ji-ji lhon ahi; Ijeh-inem itileh amani hi khopi sung ahung lutji lhon le apotji lhon hi koima chan amu louhelna dinga umlhon ahi.  
\v 18 Ahin gollhang khat chun amani hi amudoh tan, hi chun gollhang pa chu achen Absalom kom'a aga seipeh tai; hijeh chun amani jong kinloi tah in achemang loi lhon'in, Bahurim khoa pasal khat insunga ahunglut lhon'in ahileh, amapa hin a invel'a chun twikul khat aneiye; hijeh chun amani jong twikul sunga chun alut lhon'in akisel lhon tai.  
\v 19 Hichun numei khat hin twikul kam sinna ding khat alan, akama chun aphan, achunga chun chang aphou khumin ahileh imacha aum lam akihedoh tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Absalom sepai te chu hiche inmun a numeinu kom ahung phat uvin ama hon jong, “Ahimaaz le Jonathan chu hoilam a um lhon tam?” tia adoh uleh, numeinun jong ajah uva aseipeh in, “Amani chu twidung khu galkai lhon tante” atipeh e. Amaho chun agahol uvin amudoh joulou phat uvin Jerusalem lama ahung kinungle kit tauve.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun amaho ache phat uvin Ahimaaz leh Jonathan chu twikul sunga kon'in ahung potdoh lhon'in, achepai pai lhon'in David lengpa aga seipeh lhon tan ahi. Amani hin David kom'a hitin asei lhon e, “Kipatdoh loijin, Jordan vadung galkai loitan!” ati. Ajeh chu hitobang bang hin Ahithophel chun nang dounan lunggel phalou lou mi ahil tai,” agati lhon e.  
\v 22 Chuphat in David jong akipatdoh pai-paijin, ama lhonpi mipi chutoh akilhon'in Jordan vadung agalkai tauve; chule khovah lhah phat in Jordan vadung galkai loulai khat cha aum tapouve.   
\p
\v 23 Ahithophel hin athumop chu koiman alahpeh lou amu doh phat chun sangan chunga touna akiphan, akhopi ainlam a achetai. Chuin aman ain alou asutoh sohkeiyin, chujouvin ama le ama akikhailih tai. Chuin mihon ama hi apa lhankhuh ma-man avui tauve.   
\p
\v 24 David chu Mahanaim kiti laiya chun ahungin ahi. Absalom jong chun Jordan vadung ahinpal galkai in ama ahin Israel chate abonchauvin ahung tauve.  
\v 25 Absalom hin Joab khel’in asepai te lamkai din Amasa kitipa chu ana pansah tan ahi. (Amasa kitipa hi Ishmael mi pasal khat amin Jether kitipa chapa ahin, Jether hin Joab nu, Zeru’iah sopinu Nahash kitinu chanu Abigail chu akichen pin ahi.)  
\v 26 Chuin Israel chate leh Absalom hin Gilead gamsung a ngahmun asem tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 David chu Mahanaim ahung lhun phat in, Ammon mite kho Rabbah a kon'in Nahash chapa Shobi le Lodebar khoa konna Ammiel chapa Makir toh, chule Rogelim khoa konna Gilead mi Barzillai chutoh ahungun ahi.  
\v 28 Chuin lupna jalkhun phabep le kisilna kong ho, leibel phabep toh, suhlou chang le sakol chang, neh ding an, chule changpol kansa, louthul le bekan ahin pouvin ahi.  
\v 29 Chujongleh khoiju le bongnoiha ahin, kelngoi jong, bongnoi thao jong David le alhonpi miho neh ding chun ahinpo uve; ijeh-inem itileh amaho hin asei uvin, “David le aloite mipi hi gamthip laiya gilkel uva tha lhasam tah a umah ahi tauve,” atiuvin ahi.   
\c 18  
\s1 Absalom Kijo Le Thi  
\p
\v 1 Hichun lengpa David chun apanpi sepai te chu asimdoh sohkeiyin, achung uva mi asang-sang chunga lamkai ding, aja-ja chunga lamkai ding agoltoh sohkei tan ahi.  
\v 2 David chun sepai hop thum'a hop khat chu Joab alamkai sah in, hop thum'a hop khatma chu Joab sopi pa Zeruiah chapa Abishai chu alamkai sah kit in, chutengleh hop thum'a hop khat kit ma chu Gath mi Ittai chu alamkai sah in; hichun miho kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Keima tah jong nangho toh gal ikon khom diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 3 Ahivangin mipin aseijin, “Nangma gal na kondoh louhel ding ahi bouve. Ijeh-inem itileh keiho hi hung galjam ujong leng, ama hon iman igel khoh pouvinte, keiho akeh khat hel thi jeng tau jong leng ama hon ima agel deh lou diu ahi. Nangma vang keiho mi 10,000 toh kibang nahi; chujongleh nangman khopi sunga konna kei ho panpi mi nahin sol tho joh ding hi thil phajo ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun lengpan jong hitin aseiye, “Ipi hita jongleh nangho dinga aphapen tah hi ding chu keiman kabol jeng ding ahi,” atitai. Hijeh chun lengpa chu kelkot phunga ading denin, sepai te vang chu aja-jan, asang sang'in akitol doh tauve.   
\p
\v 5 Chuin lengpan Joab, Abishai chule Ittai chu ahil dem demin, “Keima janan gollhangpa Absalom chu lungneng tah in hin bol uvin,” ati. Absalom chung changa lengpan sepai lamkai mithum athulhahna chu mipin abonchan aja sohkei uve.   
\p
\v 6 Hiti hin Ephraim gammang lah a gal akipan tan,  
\v 7 David sepai ten Israel mite chu ajou tauve, hiche nikho a mi atha u chu atam lheh jengin, mihem 20,000 alhinge.  
\v 8 Gamsung pumpia gal a kithe chan sohkei tan, chule chemjam a kisatlih sang'in gammang lah a ohlih mihem atamjon ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Absalom jong chun David sepai te atohkha khel-khel’in ahi. Absalom chu asakol pol chunga hung tou ahin, hichun sakol pol chu gangpi thing lentah khat abahkai nelnul lah khat a chun a lhailut in abahlah ahopan ahileh, Absalom chu aluchang gangpi bah lah a a-ohden tai. Chule sakol pol chun adalhan anoiya achepai tan ahi.  
\v 10 David sepai khat chun Absalom chu amudoh phat in Joab kom'a aseipeh in; “Ven, keiman Absalom chu gangpi phung bah lah a akikhai den kamui,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Joab jong chun akom'a thuseipa chu adong paijin, “Ipi? Ama namu a ibola natha lou ham? Chutin hinbol le chun keiman dangka shekel som khat beh le kong gah khat nape dinga chu!” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Ahivangin mipa chun Joab kom'a asei kit e, “Keiman dangka shekel sang khat kamu ding hijongleh lengpa chapa thana dingin kakhut lam hihhel inge; ijeh-inem itileh keiho jah tah in jong lengpan nangma le Abishai chule Ittai thu nape cheh uvin, ‘Keima janan gollhangpa Absalom chu ahingin hin hoi tei-tei un,’ tin asei bouve.  
\v 13 Lang khatma keiman kathi le kathi, tin jou le nal’in hin bol jeng jong leng, lengpa mudin imacha akisel theiya aum deh poi, chutengleh nangman nang ding bou nagel a neidon louhel ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Joab in asei paiyin, “Keiman hitobang hin nangma toh phat sumang mang ponge,” atin, gangpi phung bah lah a Absalom ahinga aum nah laiya ahileh tin Joab chun tengcha achom thum alan agah pei a ahileh Absalom lungchang don tah a akiphut tai.  
\v 15 Chuin Joab galvon poa pang gollhang sepai som khat in Absalom aumkim uvin ajep un athat tauve.   
\p
\v 16 Chuin Joab chun saki pengkul amut in ahileh sepai ho chu Israel te nung adel nauva kon'in ahung kinungle sohkei tauve.  
\v 17 Chuin ama hon Absalom long chu adom lhauvin gammang lah a kokhuh lentah khat sunga aleh lut uvin, achunga song tum tampi asep khum uvin ahi. Israel chate vang chu ama-ama inlam cheh a akijamlut soh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Chule Absalom hin ahinlaiyin lengpa phaicham a chun khom khat ana phut doh in ahi; ijeh-inem itileh aman ana seiye, “ Keiman kamin aman louna dingin chapa la kanei pon,” atin, akhom phudoh chu ama min aputsah in, hijeh chun hiche hi tuni geijin Absalom kihet jingna tin akiseiye.   
\s1 Absalom Thi David In Pul Adou  
\p
\v 19 Chujouvin Zadok chapa Ahimaaz kitipa hin “Keima lhai jing ting, Pakaijin amelma te khut a kon'in ama ahuhdoh tai, tin lengpa David kom'a ga seipeh tang e,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Ahinla Joab chun ajah a aseiye, “Tuni nangma thupole a napan thei louding ahi; nidang dang leh thupon pang nan nate, tunia vang thupo a napan thei louhel ding ahi; ijeh-inem itileh lengpa chapa athi tai,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin Joab chun mipa kom'a, “Nangma chen lang nathil mubang bang chun, lengpa gaseipeh tan,” ati. Chuin mipa jong chu salam bolnan akun in, chujouvin alhaijel tai.   
\p
\v 22 Ahin Ahimaaz chu Joab kom'a aseikit in, “Ipi soh jongleh, lungset tah in kei jong mipa nunga khun lhai tang e,’ atikit leuvin ahi.  
\p Hichun Joab chun aphoh in, “Na thupoh jeh a kipaman bon mulou dinga, ipi pen deichat na a nangma nalhai jeng ding ham, chapa?” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Ahivangin aman, “Heng'e, hijongleh kei jong lhai jeng ing e,” atia aseikit phat in, Joab jong chun ajah a aseipeh in, “Aphai, lhaijin,” ati tai. Chutah chun Ahimaaz chu phaicham lang Mahanaim lampi a chun alhai in ahileh Ethiopia mipa chu akhel tai.   
\p
\v 24 David chu kelkot teni kikah a toujing jeng ahin, kelkot ngahpa chu kelkot chung, inchung achun akaldoh in palvum a chun aum'in ahileh mikhat achanga amaho langa hunglhai khat amu tan ahi.  
\v 25 Chuphat in kelkot ngah pan lengpa ahin kouvin aseipeh tai. Lengpan jong ale seipeh kit in, “Achang ahileh thusoh ahinpoh ding ahi,” ati.  
\p “Ahung lhailut pai-pai in, ahin nailut tan,  
\v 26 chuin kelkot ngah pan michom khat ma amukit in, ama jong chu ahung lhai-lhai jeng e; chuphat in kelkot ngah pan kelkot phung lama chun ahin kouvin, “Ven, ven, mi khat jong achang seh in ahung lhai kit e!” ati.  
\p Lengpan jong asei kit in, “Ama jong khun thupha ahin poh hiya khu,” ati.   
\p
\v 27 Kelkot ngah pa chun, “Ahung lhai masajo pa khu Zadok chapa Ahimaaz lhaitoh kakilom sah lheh jenge,” atileh; lengpan jong, “Ama chu mipha ahin thupha ahin poh hiteiyin te,” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Chutah chun Ahimaaz hin lengpa ahin kouvin, “Ijakai apha sohkeiye,” ati. Chujongleh ama chu lengpa angsung a abohkhup in tol'a amai asulut in aseiye, “Pakai na Pathen, kapu lengpa douna akhut lam jouse eipedoh sohkei uvah ama chu nunnom hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Hichun lengpan jong adong pai in, “Gollhangpa Absalom ima tilou hinam?” atileh,  
\p Ahimaaz chun adonbut in, “Nasohpa hi Joab in eihin sol pet chun mihonpi kinong lul-lul kamun, ipi iti ham ti kahepoi,” ati tai.   
\p
\v 30 Chuphat in lengpan jong, “ kikhin doh inlang hikom'a khun ga ding tan,” atileh; ama jong akikhin doh pai jengin, ading thipbeh jeng tai.   
\p
\v 31 Vetan, hichun Ethiopia mipa chu ahunglhung pai tan ahi; hichun Ethiopia mipan hitin asei e, “Kapu lengpa dingin thupha tah kahinpoi! Ijeh-inem itileh Pakaijin tunia nangma dou dia kipan mite khut a kon'in na huhdoh tan ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Chuin lengpan jong Ethiopia mipa chu adong paiyin, “Gollhangpa melma te jouse leh nangma douna a thilse bol dinga kipan jouse hiche gollhangpa chutoh bang sohkei uhen,!”ati tai.   
\p
\v 33 Chuphat in lengpa chu adipdam behseh jengin, hichun indan chungnunga chun akaldoh in, akaptai; achepum pumin, “O kachapa Absalom! Kachapa; kachapa Absalom! Nang khel a kei kathi leh iti ham! Vo Absalom, kachapa, kachapa!” atin ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Joab In Lengpa Apho  
\p
\v 1 Joab kom'a chun, “Lengpa David chun Absalom pul adoulel in akap-kap jeng tai,” tithu agalhung tan ahi.  
\v 2 Hijeh chun hiche nikhoa gal kijo chu mipi abonchauva din pul douna asohdoh jotan ahi. Ijeh-inem itileh hiche nikho hin mipin abonchan ajauvin, “Lengpan achapa thi pul adoulel lheh jenge,” akiti tai.  
\v 3 Sepai te jong chu hiche nikho hin guhthim chan khopi sunga ahung kijotlut uvin, gal alel niuva jachat thoh a hung vahlut bangin ahung lut tauve.  
\v 4 Hichun lengpan amai akhut in akikhun, othongje jun lengpa akapjah jengin, “Vo Absalom, kachapa, kachapa!” atin asam-sam jeng’e.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun Joab jong lengpa insunga ahunglut in hitin aseitai, “Tuni hin nangman na sepai te jouse hinkho ahin, nangma hinkho ahin, na chate numei le pasal jouse hinkho jong chule na jite leh na thaikem ho hinkho huhhing'a pang jouse mai najum sah tai.  
\v 6 Ipi jeh-inem itileh nangman nahot bolte na lungset jon, na lungsette joh nahotbol jotai. Ajeh chu tunin nangman kichen tah in na seidoh tan, gal lamkaiho leh sepai te hi nang dinga imacha louva pang danin nabol tan ahi. Ijeh-inem itileh tuni hin Absalom chu kihing hoi henlang keiho hi kabonchauvin thigam jengu leng nangma nalung lhaijo ding ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun tun kipatdoh inlang potdoh pai-pai jengin lang nasohte kom'a thu ngaitah tah in hung sei loiyin; ijeh-inem itileh Pakai min'a kihahsel kahi, nangma nahung potdoh louva ahileh tujan jenga jong hi mihem khat a khat chan jong nagepi louhel ding ahitai; chuti henlang hileh, nachapa gollhangpa a konna na chunga hunglhung thilse hijat sanga jong hiche thilsoh ding hi khohjo ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Chuphat in lengpa jong akipatdoh jengin kelkot phunga atouna a chun atoutai. Hichun mipi abonchauva jah dingin aseipeh tai, “Vetan, lengpa khu kelkot phungbul'a atou tai,” atiuva ahileh; chuphat in mipi ho chu abonchauvin lengpa angsunga ahung kitollut soh tauve, Israel chate Absalom nungjui ho vang chu ama-ama inlam cheh a ajamlut soh tauve.  
\v 9 Israel phung chujat lah a chun mipi abonchan aboi lah-lah jeng uvin, hitin asei uve, “Lengpa David chun imelma teu khut a konna jong ina huhhing uva chule Philistine te khut akon a jong eina sochat sah u ahin, hinlah Absalom agin jeh a gamsunga konna jamdoh ahitai.  
\v 10 Chule tua ichung uva leng chang dinga thao inupau Absalom la galmun a athi tai. Chuti ahileh ibola David chu ileng diuva ilekou kit da diu ham?” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 11 Hichun David lengpan jong thempu teni Zadok le Abiathar kom'a thu athot in hitin aseiye, “Judah mi upate kom'a seipeh lhon'in lang, ‘Lengpa kom'a Israel dang jouse thu hunglhung sohta, ipi dinga nangho hi lengpa in'a puilut kit ding thuseiya anukhahpen a pang nahiuvem?  
\v 12 Nangho hi keima inkote mong-mong, kaphe le kathisan nahiuve; ahileh ipi dinga nangho lengpa pui ding thusei nukhah a napan diu ham?” ati tilhon'in.  
\v 13 Chujongleh Amasa kitipa kom'a jong naseipeh lhon ding, ‘Nang hi keima thisan le phe mong nahilou ham? Tua lhah nang hi Joab panmun khel a sepai te lamkaiya napan lou pou-pouva ahileh Pathen'in abolnom nomin eibol hen, akhoh cheh jon jong eibol hen, kapan sah ding nahi,’ tin aseiye, nati lhon ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Amasa chun Judah mite chu mihem khat seh abahsah jengin alungu kitoh del’in, athunun’in, hijeh chun ama hon thu ahin thot paiyun, lengpa henga chun, “Nang le na sepai te naboncha uvin hung kile kit jeng uvin,” atiuvin ahi.   
\s1 Jerusalem’a David Akile Kit  
\p
\v 15 Hijeh chun lengpa jong Jerusalem ahung kile kit tan ahi. Chule Jordan vadung ahunglhung tan ahile Judah jong chu lengpa lamtoa Jordan vadunga apui galkai din ahungun Gilgal ahunglhung tauve.  
\v 16 Gera chapa Shimei kitipa Benjamin phunga mipa jong chu Bahurim khoa pat in David lengpa lamto din kino tah in Judah mite chutoh ahung kilhon suh tai. \x + \xo 19:16 \xt 2 Samuel 16:5-13\x*  
\v 17 Chule midang Benjamin phunga kon mi sangkhat, Saul insunga dia sepai jalamkai Ziba jaonan, chule Ziba chapa te som le nga le asoh somni toh ahung thauvin Jordan vadung a lengpa kimupi din ahung lhailha uvin ahi.  
\v 18 Hiti chun lengpa leh a ingsung mite chutoh Jordan vadung ahung galkai un, kithopina thei chanin ijakai in ama chu akithopi uvin ahi.  
\p Shimei dinga David khotona lengpan Jordan vadung ahung galkai ding toh lhon'in, Shimei chu ama angsung'ah abohkhup in ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Shimei chu ataovin, “Ka pakai lengpa, lungset tah in nei ngaidam in,” nangman Jerusalem na dalhah a na lhachan thil phalou tah-tah kabol ho chu haimil inlang na lungsungah jong umsah datan.  
\v 20 Keiman kahei ichan a chonse kahi hitam. Hijeh a chu tunia hilai mun hung kahi, Israel te jouse lah a dinga ka pakai lengpa lamto masapen a,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Chuin Zeruiah chapa Abishai in asei in, Shimei hi tha ding ahi, ajeh chu aman leng thao kinupa hi agaosap ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun David in ahinsei in, “Zeruiah chapa kon nang nadoh beh ham!” ati. “Ipi dinga tunia nangma keima melma a pang go nahim? Tuni hi achaini ahipoi, ajeh chu tunia hi keima avel'a Israel te leng kahi kit ahitai!” ati.  
\v 23 Hichun Shimei lamma akihei in, David akihahsellin, “Na hinkho hi kahing hoi ding ahi,” ati.   
\s1 David In Mephibosheth Akhoto  
\p
\v 24 Chuin Saul tupa Mephibosheth chu Jerusalem ahungsuh in lengpa ahung kimupin ahi. Lengpan Jerusalem adalhah nikhoa pat chun akeng, akhamul chule avon sop ding imacha akhohsah tapon ahi. \x + \xo 19:24 \xt 2 Samuel 9:1-13; 16:1-4\x*  
\v 25 Chuin lengpan adonbut in, “Mephibosheth ipi dinga keima toh nahung khom lou ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Hichun Mephibosheth in adonbut in, “Ka pakai lengpa, kasohpa Ziba in eijoulhep in ahi. Keiman kaseipeh in, 'ka sangan chu gongtoh in khuti leh lengpa toh kache khom thei ding ahi' kati. Ajeh chu nangman neihet banga keima hi elbai kahi.  
\v 27 Keima kahungnom lou danin Ziba in asei in eijoulhep e. Ahin keiman kahenai ka pakai kalengpa hi Pathen vantil tobang nahin, hijeh chun nangman gel inlang aphapen chun bol tan.  
\v 28 Chule keima le ka insung mite jouse hi athi dinga lom kahi bou uve ka pakai, hinlah hichu hilouvin nangman nei jabol in na dokhangah an nei nehkhompi e! Hiche kalval a chu ipi kathum nahlai ding ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 29 “Nangman aphatai nati,” chuin David in adonbut in, “Nangma le Ziba hi na gamsung chu kitohchet a nakihop lhon dingin kagel lhatai,” ati.   
\p
\v 30 Chuin Mephibosheth in aseijin, “Chan jouse chu ama petan, nangma damsel'a nahung kile kit hi keidin aphaset tai, ka pakai le kalengpa,” ati.   
\s1 David In Barzillai Akhuto  
\p
\v 31 Gilead mi Barzillai chu Rogelim akon ahungsuh in Jordan vadung'ah lengpa chu ahung kimupin ahi. \x + \xo 19:31 \xt 2 Samuel 17:27-29\x*  
\v 32 Ama hi akum ahan tan mi damthei tah kum somget ahitan ahi. Chule ama hi lengpa Mahanaim aumlai a neh ding pepa chu ahi.  
\v 33 Chuin lengpan Barzillai kom'ah asei in “Hungin lang keitoh Jerusalem ah hung cheng tan. Keiman hilai mun a chu nangma kavetsui ding nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 34 Hichun Barzillai in ahin donbut in, “Ahipoi, keima Jerusalem chan hung dingin kateh valtai.  
\v 35 Tun keima kum somget kahi tan, chule keiman imacha ka nopsahpi thei aum tapoi. Ju le an jeng jong atui tapon, chule lasa them ho lasah jong kangai nom tapoi. Keima hi ka pakai lengpa dia alungkhamna bep kahi ding ahitai.  
\v 36 Lengpa toh Jordan lui galkai ding bou chu ka ngaichat thupi pen ahijoi.  
\v 37 Chutengleh keima athi dia kanu le kapa kivuina gamsunga kakinungle ding ahi. Ahin hiche hi nasohpa ka chapa Kimham ahi. Ama hi ka pakai kalengpa toh kilhon henlang chule nangman napeh nom chan chu aman kisan hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 38 Chuin lengpa jong anom tan, “Aphai, Kimham toh kache khom ding chule aman adei nalam chan a kakithopi ding chule adei angai chan kabolpeh ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 39 Hiti chun mipi jouse chu lengpa toh Jordan agalkai tauvin ahi. Chuin David in Barzillai chu phatthei aboh a achop jouvin, Barzillai chu a inlam akile kit tan ahi.   
\p
\v 40 Chuin lengpan Kimham alhonpin Gilgal akhokel tan ahi. Judah sepai jouse le Israel sepai kehkhat in lampi ah ana lamto uvin ahi.   
\s1 Lengpa Chunga Kinelna  
\p
\v 41 Ahin Israel mite jouse chu lengpa chungah akiphin tauvin, “Judah miten lengpa chu ana tomchah kheh un, keihon nang nahin namite ahin Jordan nahung galkaina diuvin kithopina ding phat eipe pouve,” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Chuin Judah miten adonbut un, “Lengpa hi keiho son chilhah mong ahi. Ipi dinga hiche hin nasuh lunghang uham? Keihon lengpa akon neh ding ahilouleh thil phachom ima kakisan pouve!” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 43 Ahin adang hon ahin donbut un, “Israel sungah phung som aum nalai e. Hijeh chun keihon lengpa chungah somvei jen nangho bol bangin thaneina kanei uve. Hitobang a bolna dinga hi ipi tha nanei uham? Keiho hi kahi lou uham amasapen a ama hi leng hisah kit ute tia chu?” Kinelna chu anung ama ah achejom jingin chule Juda mite chu Israel mite sangin aham ngaimo lheh un ahi.   
\c 20  
\s1 Sheba Galbol  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phatlai hin boina sem mikhat ana um'in amapa chu amin Sheba akiti, ama hi apa min Bicri ahin, Benjamin phunga mi ahiye. Chule Sheba kitipa hin saki pengkul amut gingin lhang asamin aseitai,  
\b  
\q1 “David kom'a eihon chan ding inei pouvin,  
\q2 Jesse chapa kom'a goulo ding inei pouve.’  
\q1 Vo Israel mite,  
\q2 nangma nangma ponbuh kijot cheh tauvin!” ati. \x + \xo 20:1 \xt 1 Lgt 12:16; 2 Thusimbu 10:16\x*   
\b  
\p
\v 2 Hiche jeh chun Israel miten abonchauvin David adalha sohhel tauvin, Bicri chapa Sheba nung ajui cheh tauve. Ahivangin Judah miten alengpau chu lunglut tah in Jordan vadunga pat Jerusalem geiyin ajuilut peh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 3 David chu Jerusalem'a ahungin ain ahunglhung tai, chuin lengpan in ngah dinga adalhah thaikem numei som ho chu abonchan aman khom sohkeiyin in khat a akoikhom in, chule hiche in chu mi angah ding sepai akoiyin, neh le chah vang apenan, amaho hi avil tapon, aluppi tapoi. Hijeh chun amaho hi athini gei uvin cha hing louvin aum sohkeiyun, meithai bangin aum sohkei tauve. \x + \xo 20:3 \xt 2 Samuel 16:22\x*   
\p
\v 4 Hichun lengpan Amasa kom'a aseipeh in, “Nithum sungin Judah phunga mite abonchan kou khom sohkeiyin lang, nangma tah jeng jong hikom'a hin hung kikhom uvin,” ati.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Amasa jong Judah mite kou dingin akondoh tan, ahinla ama dinga aphat kiteppeh sanga tamjo ahin latan ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Chuphat in David chun Abishai kom'a chun aseijin, “Tua hi Sheba kitipa Bicri chapa khun Absalom'in eibol nau sanga khohjoa eibol diu ahi. Nangman napu lhacha sepai te khu kipuiyin lang anung delpeh inlang, gaman tan achuti louva ahileh aman kulpi kikaikhum khopi phabep akisah doh a eiho eisuh genthei diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Chuin Abishai le Joab, lengpa ngahtup sepai ho toh, chule mihat jouse jong abonchan akitol sohkeiyuvin ahi. Chule amaho hi Jerusalem khopia kon'in Bicri chapa Sheba nung del dingin akondoh tauve.  
\v 8 Amaho hi Gibeon khopia songpi lentah phung ahunggei uvin Amasa jong amaho lamto dingin ahung tai. Hichun Joab hi sepai vonin akivonin, chule akongjanga chun konggah khat hin chemjam apaiyin akipoh in ahi. Amasang lam uva Amasa chibai bol din achepheijin, hichun ahung kibalhun achemjam chu ahung kitholdoh paitan ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Joab hin Amasa kom'a hitin aseiye, “Sopi nadam dam hinam? tin adongin, hiti chun Joab hin Amasa chu akhut jetlam in amanin achop ding bangin anemul chun atuh chah jenge.  
\v 10 Hichea hi Amasa hin Joab in akhut veilam a chemjam akidop lam chu anahet lou ahiye; hiti hin Joab chun Amasa chu a oipoh asutpeh in; hichun avel'a sat kit louhel’in khatvei seh-seh chun ama jong athidel jengin ahi. Chujouvin Joab le asopipa Abishai chun Bicri chapa Sheba nung chu adel pai-pai tauve.   
\p
\v 11 Chule Joab sepai te lah a mi khat chu Amasa long phunga aga dingin hitin aseiye, “Koi-koi hijongleh Joab panpia David dinga pang jouse chun Joab nung jui cheh hen,” ati.  
\v 12 Hichun Amasa vang chu lamlen kim laitah a athisan lah a akisai saiyin alumden tai. Lampia hung mijouse chun amudoh tengule ading cheh jiuvin, hijeh chun alongkom a dingpa chun miho jouse agahdinji jeh u chun Amasa long chu akaimangin gamlah a apolut in pon akhu khumtan ahi.  
\v 13 Chuin Amasa chu lamlen lailunga konna akaimang phat chun mipi sepai jouse jong chun Joab nung juiya Bicri chapa Sheba nung del dingin ache pai-pai jeng tauve.   
\p
\v 14 Sheba hin Israel phung jouse ana chon sohkeijin, achainan Abel-beth-maacah chan gei anajot man in ahi; hijeh chun Bicri mite jouse akikhom uvin ama nung ajui sohhel tauve.  
\v 15 Hichun Joab toh pang khom mite chu abonchan ahung uvin Abel-beth-maacah khoa chun Sheba aga’um tauve. Khopi umnan pal akai uvin, chule khopi pal chutoh kingato'n leipal chu akikhang doh jenge; chuin ama hon khopi pal chu phetjal dingin agouvin avojal pan tauve.  
\v 16 Hichun khopi sung langa kon'in numei miching tah khat hin mi ahin kouvin, “Ngaiyuvin, ngaiyuvin, keiman Joab chu kaki houpi theina dingin hin seipeh uvin lang hilai mun'a hin hung hen, ati hin tiuvin,” ahinti.  
\v 17 Hiphat chun Joab jong chu amanu kom'a chun ahungin ahileh, numeinu chun hitin aseipeh tai, “Nangma Joab nahim? atia ahileh  
\p aman jong adonbut in, “Kahinai,” ati.  
\p Hichun numei nun, “Nasohnu thusei hi chingthei tah in ngai temin,” ati.  
\p Aman adonbut in, “Kangai peh nai,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Hichun numei nun jong aseitai, “Masanga gollui laiyin tehse hon hitin ana sei uve, 'kinel baotamna chu nalhap nom leh, Abel khoa mi dong'un.'  
\v 19 Hitia chu keima jong hi Israel mite lah a chamna bolji le kitah tah a hinkho mang mi khat chu kahi; hijeh chun tun nangman Israel chate dia penna khopi khat hi thagam dingin nahol’e; ibola nangman Pakai goulo athilkeo hi hitia hi suhmang jeng ding nati ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Joab jong chun adonbut in, “Keiman itih hijongleh khopi ka suhmang louhel ding ahi!  
\v 21 Nasei chu adihpoi, ahin Ephraim gam'a thinglhang mi Bicri kitipa chapa khat amin Sheba kitipa chun David lengpa dounan akhut alamtai; ama chu hin pedoh jeng uvin, chutileh keima khopia konna hi kaki nungle jeng ding ahi,” ati. Chuphat in numeinu jong chun adonbut paiyin, Joab kom'a chun,  
\p “Aphai, naseipa chu palvuma aluchang tansa hung kileh lha ding nakom'a hung chu ding ahi,” atipeh-e.  
\v 22 Numeinu chu alungthima achihna bang dungjuijin khopi sunga anung chen mipi jouse kom'a chun hitin aga seitai. Chuin mihon Bicri chapa Sheba chu alu atan uvin, Joab kom'a chun aga seplut tauve. Chuphat in Joab chun saki pengkul chu amut paiyin, khopia kon chun akikhen cheh sohkeiyun, mijouse chu ama-ama in cheh a ache tauve. Joab vang chu Jerusalem'a lengpa kom'a dingin ahung kile kittai.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun Joab kitipa hi Israel chate pumpi dinga gal lamkai lenpen chule sepai jouse chunga vaipo ahi. Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chu sepai ho lamkai vaipon apangin ahi.  
\v 24 Chule Adoniram kitipa chu engbol a um soh natonga pangho chunga chun vaihom in apangin, Ahilud chapa Jehoshaphat kitipa chu thusim sun loiyin apange.  
\v 25 Sheva chu thutanna mun a lekha sun in apangin, Zadok le Abiathar chu thempun apang lhon'in ahi.  
\v 26 Chule Jair mi Ira vang chu David din thempun anapang tan ahi.   
\c 21  
\s1 David In Gibeon Mite Alethuh  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun leng David khanglai hin kum thum sungin kel analhan, hijeh chun David jong chun iti ding ham, tin Pakai chu adong tan ahi. Chuin Pakaijin hitin ahin seiye, “Saul chun Gibeon mite anatha jeh a Saul le a insung mite chunga thisanso jal a themmona aum jeh ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Hijeh chun lengpan jong Gibeon mite chu akoukhom sohtai. Chule Gibeon mite hi Israel chate sung peng mi ahi pouvin Amor mite chia peng athimoh ho ahi bouvui. Chule amaho hi Israel chaten thalou dinga anasei vang uvin Saul chun ami Israel chate leh Judah te dinga atom ngaina jeh a amaho hi suhgam ding anati ahi. \x + \xo 21:2 \xt Joshua 9:3-15\x*  
\v 3 David in hiche Gibeon mite kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Ipi kabol peh diu ham? Itobang mongin longman nasem peh theiyu leng nang hon hiche Pakai goulo mite hi phatthei naboh thei dingu ham?” tin adong tai.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun Gibeon miten leng David kom'a chun aseiyun, “Keiho le Saul chule a insung mite kah a thu hi dangka le sana peh a kihou chamna thei ding jong ahipoi, keihon Israel mite lah a mihem khat tou ka thalo diu thu jong ahi dehpoi,” atiuve.  
\p Chuin David chun aseikit in, “Ahile ken nangho dinga ipipen ba kabolpeh diu ham? Nei seipeh un khuti leh ken nangho dia kabolpeh ding nahiuve” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun ama hon jong lengpa kom'a chun, “Israel gamsunga chenmun gemun kanei louhelna diuva keiho suhgamna dia lunggel tohgon ananei chu Saul ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun Saul chate pasal sagi ho chu keiho khut a neihin peuvin lang, chule keihon jong amaho chu Gibeon khoa Pakai molsang chunga khun Pakai angsunga ga khailih jeng uvinge,” ati tauve.  
\p Chuphat in David jong chun, “Chuti ahileh amaho mi sagi chu nape nauvinge,” atipeh tai.  
\v 7 Lengpan Saul chapa Jonathan chapa Mephibosheth vang chu ahing hoiye; ijeh-inem itileh amanin Pakaiya kihahselna ana nei lhon ahin, David le Saul chapa Jonathan in kihahselna ana neisa lhon ahitai. \x + \xo 21:7 \xt 1 Samuel 20:15-17; 2 Samuel 9:1-7\x*  
\v 8 Chuin lengpan Aiah chanu Saul jinu Rizpah chapa teni Armoni le Mephibosheth amanin, Saul chanu Merab chapa te mi nga jong amanin, amaho hi Merab hin Meholath mipa Barzillai chapa Adriel kitipa chutoh ahin lhon ahi; \x + \xo 21:8 \xt 1 Samuel 18:19\x*  
\v 9 David in mi sagi hi Gibeon mite khut a apedoh tai; chuin ama hon jong hiche pasal sagi ho chu molsang chunga Pakai angsunga akhaiyuvin, mi sagi jen chu athigam tauve. Amaho atha niu chu sakol chang-at kipat til ni chu anahi.   
\p
\v 10 Chuin Rizpah kitinu amin Aiah chanu hin khaodip pon akilah in, songpi chung khat a akisil khaodip pon chu aphan, chang-at kipat til apat chun van'a konna chuh go ahung juh kahsen apha-pha jenge; sun teng jongleh chunga leng vachate aponpha chunga chun atousah pon, chubang ma chun jan teng jongleh gamsa ho chu ponpha chunga chun alutsah dehpon ahi.  
\v 11 Chuin Saul thaikemnu Aiah chanu Rizpah thilbol umchan chu David kom'a aseipeh phat un,  
\v 12 David jong achen Saul leh achapa Jonathan gu-lheng lhon chengse beh chu Jabesh-gilead mipi ho koma'ah agalan ahi. (Philistine miten Gilboa molsang chunga Saul ajo chung uva, Philistine mihon Saul leh achapa Jonathan Beth-shan kholai dunga akhai nauva aga guh doh-u anahi.) \x + \xo 21:12 \xt 1 Samuel 31:8-13\x*  
\v 13 David chun hiche mun'a kon chun Saul leh achapa Jonathan gu-lheng lhon ho chu agapon, chuin mihon amani banga kikhailih jouse gubuh chengse chutoh akoikhom tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Chuin lengpan gu-lheng lhon ho chu Benjamin gamsunga Zela khopia Saul pa Kish lhan khuh a avui diuvin thupeh aneitan ahi. Chule miho hin lengpa thupeh bang bangin abol sohkei uvin ahi. Hiche nunghin Pathen'in gamsunga kellhah chu akichai sah tan ahi.   
\s1 Israel Te Leh Philistine Mihat Ho Kidouna  
\p
\v 15 Hichun Philistine mite chun Israel chate dounan gal ahinbol uvin ahileh, David lengpa jong chu asepai te toh kilhon'in gal akonsuh kit in Philistine mite dounan gal agasat tauve. Hichun David jong chu atha achol lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 16 Chuti chun gal mun'a chun Rapha gal-hatpa chilhah a mi khat amin Ishbi-benob kiti pa hi apangin, ama chu atengcha jeng jong agih dan sum-eng jeng pounds sagi alhingin, chule ama hin chemjam thahlih khat akonga akikon, David chu tha jeng dingin ahin gotan ahi.  
\v 17 Ahin Zeruiah chapa Abishai chun David ahung panpin, Philistine te gal-hatpa chu adel khumin athat tan ahi. Chuphat in David chu asepai ten ajada uvin, “Nangma tukal keiho toh gal ikon khom louhel diu ahitai! Achuti loule namoh thilo ding ahin, Israel chate lah a meivah iti kimut mit ding ham?” atiuve. \x + \xo 21:17 \xt 1 Lgt 11:36; Labu 132:17\x*   
\p
\v 18 Hiche jou nunghin Gob mun'a Philistine te toh gal kisatna aum kittai; hichea hin Hushah mi Sibbecai kitipa chun Philistine gal-hat miho chilhah te lah a mi khat Saph kitipa chu athat kit e.   
\p
\v 19 Gob mun ma-ma a chun Philistine te ma-ma chutoh gal kisatna ana umkit in ahi. Hichea jong hin Bethlehem khoa mi Elhanan kiti Jair chapa chun Gath mi Goliath sopipa athat kit in ahi, Goliath tenglung chu thingtum tejen aphan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Chujouvin Gath khoa gal ahung sohkit tai; chule galmun'a chun mi adung sangtah khat ana um'in, amapa chu akhutphang langkhat cheh a chun akhutjung gup-gup akeh in chule akengphang lang khat gel a jong chun akengjung gup-gup cheh akeh in, abonchan akhut jung le akengjung agoma somni le li alhingin, chule ama jong hi gal-hat mihangte chilhah khatma anahin ahi.  
\v 21 Ahin aman Israel mite thu ngai louva, aseiset phat chun David sopipa Shimea chapa Jonathan in athat tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Philistine mi hicheng li hi Gath khoa gal hang mihatte son leh chilhah ahiuve, ahin abonchauvin David le asepai te khut a ana thisohkei tauvin ahi.   
\c 22  
\s1 David Thangvah La  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun Pakaijin amelma te jousea kon leh Saul khut a konna ana huhhing jal in David in hiche la hi Pakai henga anasan ahi.  
\v 2 Hitin lacheng asem e:  
\b  
\q1 “Pakai chu keima dingin Ka songpi, ka kulpi, chule eihuhhingpa ahi,   
\q2
\v 3 Ka Pathen chu kasongpi, Kakiselna nahi;  
\q1 Kapho le eihuhhinga kasakhia pang,  
\q2 ka kulpi pal le kakiselna nahin,  
\q1 eihuhhingpa nahi,  
\q2 pumhat a kinona lah a jong nei huhdohji e.   
\q1
\v 4 Vahchoi dinga lomtah Pakai henga kataojin,  
\q2 chule ka melma te a kon'in huhhingna kachang tai.   
\b  
\q1
\v 5 “Ajeh chu thina luipin eilon khum tan;  
\q2 Manthah na lam jousen eilon khum tai.   
\q1
\v 6 Noimigam khaoguijin eihen tan;  
\q2 kamasanga thina ding thang akikam’e.   
\q1
\v 7 Ahin ka genthei pet in Pakai henga ka taovin;  
\q2 ka Pathen kom'a chun eipanpi din kataovin ahi.  
\q1 Pathen Hou-In a aman kataona asang jin;  
\q2 hichea chun anabenga kataona alutji e.”   
\b  
\q1
\v 8 “Hichun liing akihot tan leiset akinuh jin ahi.  
\q2 Van todap khompi jouse jong akiling soh hel jenge;  
\q1 Pathen alung han jeh chun lingpi ahin hot jengin ahi.   
\q1
\v 9 Chule Anah hom sung tenia kon'in meikhu ahung kitung doh in;  
\q2 chule akamsung a kon'in mi bahgam thei mei akonge.  
\q2 Meial deujeju Pathen a kon'in ahung kitung doh jenge.   
\q1
\v 10 Aman van mun jouse ahongin ahung kumlhai;  
\q2 Akengto noiya muthim lhangkhal akiheh jenge.   
\q1
\v 11 Pathen Cherub chunga atouvin alenge,  
\q2 huipia akijap a alen akimui.   
\q1
\v 12 Aman akimvela muthim lhangkhal akihehsah jin,  
\q2 chule aloupina meilhang thuh tah twipin akikhange.   
\q1
\v 13 A angsung vahchan thethu lah a kon'in,  
\q2 meikong am lenglung ahung lengdohji e.   
\q1
\v 14 Pakaijin van'a kon'in van akithinsah jin;  
\q2 Hatchungnungpen chun o-thongin thu aseiye.   
\q1
\v 15 Aman athalpi ahinkap dohjin adoudal te athe chehji e;  
\q2 kol aphen akithe jal lah-lah jeng'e.   
\q1
\v 16 Pakaijin ahinpho jia,  
\q2 Anah homsunga ahu alha teng,  
\q1 twikhanglen togei geiyin akimu theiyin,  
\q2 vannoi bulpi khom jouse jong akimu theije.   
\b  
\q1
\v 17 Van chungsang langa kon'in aman eihin huhdoh jin jin,  
\q2 twipi kinong a kon'in eiladohji e.   
\q1
\v 18 Chule kamelma hattah pa a kon'in eihuhdoh jin,  
\q2 eihotbol miho hi kei din ahatval jiuve.   
\q1
\v 19 Ka hamsetni jongleh amaho hin eihin del khum jeng jiuvin,  
\q2 ahin Pakaijin keima eikithopi jing nai.   
\q1
\v 20 Aman bitna mun a eipuilut jin;  
\q2 aman eihuhdohji ajehchu eikipapi e.   
\q1
\v 21 Lamdih a kachon jing jeh in Pakaijin kipaman eipen;  
\q2 chule kakhut te nin thil dih jeng abol jing jeh in kipaman eipei.   
\q1
\v 22 Ajeh chu keiman Pakai lamlhahna jouse kajui jingin;  
\q2 agilou bol’in ka Pathen chu kada lha khapoi.   
\q1
\v 23 Ijeh-inem itileh ama chonna dan jouse chu kajuijin;  
\q2 ama chonna dan jousea keima kavah mang khapoi.   
\q1
\v 24 Ama angsunga keima nolnabeiyin kaum jingin,  
\q2 chonsetna a konin kakiveng jing jenge.   
\q1
\v 25 Hijeh chun keima dihna jeh hin Pakaijin kipaman eipei.  
\q2 Aman mimol kahina amui.   
\b  
\q1
\v 26 “Mikitah ho hengah nang jong na kitahna namusah in,  
\q2 chule nolnabei mi hengah nang jong nolnabei nahina namusah jin ahi.   
\q1
\v 27 Mi lungthengho hengah nalung thenna namusah in,  
\q2 chule milungthim thenglou ho hengah nangma alung thenglou bangin naumji.   
\q1
\v 28 Chuti chun nangman mi kineosah te chu nahuhdoh jin,  
\q2 mi kiletsah te vang chu suhnem din na velhi jinge.   
\q1
\v 29 O Pakai nangma hi keiya din ka thaomei nahin,  
\q2 Pakai nangin kei dia muthim jouse na salvah e.   
\q1
\v 30 Nangma panpina jalla keiman sepai hon khat jong ka suhmang ding,  
\q2 chule ka Pathen vanga palvum jong ka chop khup ding ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 31 Hiti chun Pathen hi alamlhahna jouse achamkim sohkeiyin,  
\q2 Pakaijin mi athutep jong aguilhungji e.  
\q2 Chule Ama kom'a kiselte dingin Ama hi ompho ahi jing'e.   
\q1
\v 32 Ijeh-inem itileh Pathen kiti chu koi dang ham?  
\q2 Ahin I-Pathen'u songpi chu koipen ham?   
\q1
\v 33 Hiche Pathen hi keima kiselna dettah ahin,  
\q2 chule ka lamlhahna jouse chamkim'in eisempeh tai.   
\q1
\v 34 Hichun Pathen'in ka kengphang teni jong sajuhpi keng abahsah in,  
\q2 gam kenlah dung jenga jong det tah in eidinsah theiye. \x + \xo 22:34 \xt Habakkuk 3:19\x*   
\q1
\v 35 Chule kakhut teni jong galsatje eihil them in,  
\q2 sum-eng thalpi lapna din Aman ka banjang ahahsah e.   
\q1
\v 36 Nangman na mihuhhingna ompho neipen,  
\q2 na kithopina chun eisuloupi jin ahi.   
\q1
\v 37 Kanoiya ka pansatna ding mun lentah nei hoipeh in  
\q2 hijeh chun ka kengto teni ka lhonal tapoi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 38 Ka melmate nung kadel jin ka thatgam ji;  
\q2 aboncha kasuh gamhel masangin kakinga jipoi.   
\q1
\v 39 Hiti chun abonchauvin kasat chap hel jin;  
\q2 koima athoudoh aum tapon;  
\q2 ka kengto noiya akijam chap tauvin ahi.   
\q1
\v 40 Ajeh chu nangin galsat din tha neipen,  
\q2 eihin delkhumpa chu kanoiya nalupsah tai.   
\q1
\v 41 Hiti chun kamasanga ka melmate najam sah-sah jin,  
\q2 eihot bolte chu keiman kathat gam jitai.   
\q1
\v 42 Panpi ngaiya apen-pen vang uvin ahuhhing diu koima aumpoi.  
\q2 Pakai henga atao vang uvin aman adonbut dehpoi.   
\q1
\v 43 Keiman kholai dunga leivui bangin kachilngem ngemin;  
\q2 chule kholai dunga bonlhoh bangin kachot phan ka chilgoi ji e.   
\b  
\q1
\v 44 “Gal eibol khum mitea kon'in gaojona neipen ahi.  
\q2 namtin vaipi chunga alenpenin neisemin;  
\q2 kahet khah louhel miten jong keima kin abol tauve.   
\q1
\v 45 Gamdang mite jong kineosah tah in kaheng'a ahungun,  
\q2 ka thusei ajah jah ule kathun anung jiuve.   
\q1
\v 46 Gamdang mite chu alungu aneo jin  
\q2 akisel nau kulsunga kon kithing pumin ahung potdoh jiuve.   
\b  
\q1
\v 47 “Pakai hingjing pa! Nunnom hen kasongpi chu!  
\q2 Ka Pathen, eihuhhinga songpi chu, choi-at in um jing hen!   
\q1
\v 48 Phu eilah sah a Pathen chun;  
\q2 mijouse chu keima noiya asonkun soh hel'in   
\q1
\v 49 kamelma te lah jenga jong eihuhdoh ji ahi.  
\q2 Nangin kakidoupi kamelma te chunga neichoi sang ji in;  
\q2 pumhat jenga mi nokhum mite lah a kon'in jong nei huhdoh jing jin ahi.   
\q1
\v 50 Hiche jeh hin, Vo Pakai, namtin la ah na vahchoi inge;  
\q2 chule namin vahchoila sange. \x + \xo 22:50 \xt Rm 15:9\x*   
\q1
\v 51 Nangman Lenga natun keima hi galjona loupi tah neipen;  
\q2 thao nanusa kei hi long louvin nei ngailui,  
\q2 David le achilhah te dia atonsot atonsot geiya dingin,” ati.   
\c 23  
\s1 David Kamcheng Soh Achaina  
\p
\v 1 Hiche ho hi ahi, leng David in achaina lama ana seidoh thucheng ho chu:  
\b  
\q1 David, Jesse chapa in thusoh ding asei—  
\q2 David, choisanga umpan thusoh ding asei chu,  
\q1 David, Jacob Pathen thao nusa,  
\q2 David, Israel chate lah a lathem penpa chu.   
\b  
\q1
\v 2 “Pakai Lhagaovin keiya kon'in thu aseijin,  
\q2 ama thu ho ka kamsunga aum'in ahi.   
\q1
\v 3 Chule Israel Pathen'in thu aseije.  
\q2 Israel Songpi chun kakom'a thu ahin seitai:  
\q2 Thudih a vaihompa chun Pathen ging pum'in vai ahom'in,   
\q1
\v 4 ama chu jing ninou bangin ahung soh jin,  
\q2 twimei kailou ni jingkah a jing ninou ahungso abange,  
\q1 chule leiset chunga hamhing le loudong  
\q2 phatthei sah gotwi hung julha tobang ahi.   
\b  
\q1
\v 5 “Pathen'in alhen chu ka insung hilou ham?  
\q2 Ahi, aman atonsot geiya dingin kitepna eisempeh e.  
\q1 Thil ijakai hi abih bih chan aumsah sohkeiye.  
\q2 Aman bitna le lolhinna eimusah tei ding ahi.   
\q1
\v 6 Ahin Pathen hephalou te chu ling kisat tan a kipai ding tobang ahiuvin,  
\q2 ijeh-inem itileh amaho hi khut a kichom khom kit thei louhel ding ahiuve.   
\q1
\v 7 Amaho phuhlhuhna dia chu thih le tengcha kipat ding ahin;  
\q2 abonchauva hi meiya kigouvam hel ding ahiuve,” ati.   
\s1 David Dia Gal-hang Miho  
\p
\v 8 David lengpa sepai te lah a dinga gal-hat mite chu amin'u hicheng hi ahiuve: Akhatna chu Joshobeam kitipa chu Hacmon mi ahin, ama hi David dia gal-hangpen mi thum lah a alamkai ahi; chule ama hin khatvei kisattona a mi 800 jen atengchan athat in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Chule ama ban a mihat mithum holah a khat kitpa chu ahile Ahoah chilhah, Dodai chapa Eleazar ahi. Ama hi Philistine te galbol dia ahung kikhop uva Israel chate jouse ajam uchun ama leh David bou ana kithon ahi.  
\v 10 Eleazar hi akipanin abantha acholdeh kahsen Philistine te asat chap-chap jengin akhut jeng jong chu achemjam chutoh thisanin atomchah jengin ahi; hiche nikho jong chun Pakaijin Israel chate minthang tah in gal ajosah tai; chule Eleazar nunga chun sepai te thilong chom khom mai maiyin ahung kitol uve.   
\p
\v 11 Chule Eleazar ban a mihat athum channa pa chu Shammah ahin, ama hi Harar mi Agee chapa ahiye. Ama hi Lehi khoa chun Philistine te galbol din ahung kikhom uvin ahileh, akikhop nau tollhang dunga chun louthul adimset in akeh e. Ahin hiche mun achun Israel chate chu Philistine te ginnan ajam tauve,  
\v 12 ahivangin Shammah hi dettah in apangin, louthul lei laiya chun apang jingin, Philistine te chu athat that jengin ahileh Pakaijin jong loupi tah in Shammah chu gal ajosah tai.   
\p
\v 13 Chang-at phat laiya hin Adullam songko sunga David aum laijin, Rephaim phaicham'a chun Philistine sepai hon khat in ngah mun anasem uve. Gal-hang somthum lah a mithum ho chu akumsuh uvin David aga kimupi uve.  
\v 14 Hiche pet hin David chu kulpi sunga anapange; chujongleh Philistine mite sepaiho chu Bethlehem khopia ana pansa uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Dangchah geovin David chun aseijin, “Ohe, mihem khatcha beh in Bethlehem khopi kulpi kelkot phunga twikul'a konin twi eihin doppeh henlang don din eihung petave leh,” ati.  
\v 16 Hichun hiche mihat mithumho hin Philistine te ngahmun kimlai tah chu atum keh jeng uvin Bethlehem khopi kulpi kelkot phunga twikula twi chu agathal uvin, David henga ahin dop peh tauve. Ahin David chun donjo talouvin atwi chu Pakai lhai nan tol'a asung lhan;  
\v 17 Chule hitin aseitai, “Vo Pakai, keiman hiche twi hi don hihhel inge. Iti ahinkho phal ngam hel a hiche twi thal a che ho thisan tobang hiche hi keiman kadon ding ham?” ati. Hiche jeh chun David in twi chu adon tapoi. Thil hijatpi hi hiche mihat mihangsan mithum ho chun anabol’u ahi.   
\s1 David Gal-hang Mi Somthum  
\p
\v 18 Chujouvin Joab sopipa, Zeruiah chapa Abishai chu mihat somthum lah a lamkaiya ana pang ahi. Chule ama hin mihem jathum jen chu atengcha akipat in akisat pin abonchau chun athat gamhel in, mithum ho tilouvin ama jong chu aminthang penin apangtai.  
\v 19 Abishai chu mihat somthum lah a aminthang pentah a pang ahi. Hijeh chun ama hi mihat thum ho lah a ajaolou vang'in amaho gal lamkaiyin apange; .   
\p
\v 20 Kabzeel khoa mi Jehoiada chapa Benaiah kitipa jong chu gal-hang tah mi ahin, chule thil nasa tah-tah boldoh jeng thei ahi. Ama hin Moab mi sakei tobang ni athat in, chujouvin nikhat hi buhbang lhah nin achesuh in kokhuh sung khat a sakei bahkai khat agathat kit e.  
\v 21 Benaiah hin Egypt mi pasal thahat tah le mel-hoi tah khat jong athat e. Egypt mipa chun akhut a tengcha khat akichoi ahin, Benaiah chun tenggol khat akichoiyin ajonsuh jengin, hichun Egypt mipa khut a kon'in atengcha chu alahpeh in ama tengcha ma-ma chun hiche Egypt mipa chu athat tai.  
\v 22 Jehoiada chapa Benaiah chun thil hijat hi anabol in, mihat mi thum lah a chun aman jong minthanna aneitan ahi.  
\v 23 Chule ama jong hi mihat somthum lah a aminthang lheh tan, ahivangin mihat thumho lah a chun ajao naipoi. Ahivangin David chun amapa hi ama tahsa vengtup sepai lah a lamkai din apansah tai.   
\p
\v 24 Mihat mi somthum lah a jao ho chu:  
\b  
\li1 Joab sopipa Asahel;  
\li1 Elhanan ahin, ama hi Bethlehem khoa Dodo chapa ahin;   
\li1
\v 25 Harod khoa mi Shammah ahin;  
\li1 Harod kho mi ma-ma Elika ahin;   
\li1
\v 26 Pelon khoa mi Helez ahin;  
\li1 Tekoa khoa mi Ikkesh chapa Ira ahin;   
\li1
\v 27 Anathoth khoa mi Abiezer ahin;  
\li1 Hushah khoa mi Sibbecai ahin;   
\li1
\v 28 Ahoah khoa mi Zalmon ahin;  
\li1 Netophah khoa mi Maharai ahin;   
\li1
\v 29 Netophah khoa mi Heled chapa Baanah ahin;  
\li1 Benjamin mite Gibeah khoa mi Ribai chapa Ithai ahin;   
\li1
\v 30 Pirathon khoa mi Benaiah ahin;  
\li1 Nahale-gaash luidung lama konna hung Hurai ahin;   
\li1
\v 31 Arabah khoa konna Abi-albon ahin;  
\li1 Bahurim khoa mi Azmaveth ahin;   
\li1
\v 32 Shaalbon khoa mi Eliahba ahin;  
\li1 Jashen chapa;  
\li1 Jonathan  
\v 33 Harar khoa mi Shagee ahin;  
\li1 Harar khoa akon mi mama Sharar chapa Ahiam ahin;   
\li1
\v 34 Maacah khoa mi Ahasbai chapa Eliphelet ahin;  
\li1 Giloh khoa mi Ahithophel chapa Eliam ahin;   
\li1
\v 35 Carmel khoa mi Hezro ahin;  
\li1 Arba khoa mi Paarai ahin;   
\li1
\v 36 Zobah khoa mi Nathan chapa Igal ahin;  
\li1 Gad mi Bani ahin;   
\li1
\v 37 Ammon mi Zelek ahin;  
\li1 Beeroth khoa mi Naharai ahin;  
\li1 Zeruiah chapa Joab galvonpoa pang pa ahin;   
\li1
\v 38 Jattir khoa mi Ira ahin;  
\li1 Jattir kho mi ma-ma Gareb ahin;   
\li1
\v 39 Hit mi Uriah ahi.  
\b  
\m abonchauvin somthum le sagi alhing uvin ahi.   
\c 24  
\s1 David In Mi Asimtoh  
\p
\v 1 Israel chate chunga Pakai ahung lunghang kittan, hijeh chun aman David chu atildoh in amaho suhgimna din mijat simna tohgon aneisah tan ahi. “Nangma chen lang Israel chate le Judah mite gasim toh tan,” tin Pakaijin aseipeh tai.   
\p
\v 2 Hijeh chun lengpan Joab le apanpi sepai lamkai ho kom'a aseijin, ‘Sahlam Dan apet lhanglam Beersheba chan geiya cheng Israel phung jouse gakhol toh sohkeiyun lang mihem ijat mong-mong hitam ti ka hetdoh theina dingin mihem jat gasim tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Ahivangin Joab chun lengpa kom'a chun aseijin, “Pakai na Pathen'in mipi ho chu aja ajan punsah jeng tahta, kapu lengpan namit a namu jeng nah chu me! Ipi dinga kapu lengpan hitobang pihi bol ding nagot hitam?” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah lengpan amaho chu mi aga simtoh diuvin aseitan ahi, hijeh chun Joab le sepai lamkaite chu Israel mipite simtoh dingin lengpa angsunga kon'in avaikon doh tauve.  
\v 5 Chuin ama hon amasapen in Jordan vadung chu apal galkaiyun lhanglam khopi phaicham, Aroer khopi Gad lam jotna ah chun aponbuh asongun, chujouvin Jazer langa achepai tauvin,  
\v 6 chujouvin Tahtim-hodshi gamsunga Gilead le Dan-jaan le Sidon vellah acheuvin ahi.  
\v 7 Chuin Tyre gammang lah ahinjot uvin Hiv mite khopi jouse le Canaan mite khopi jousea ahung uvin ahi. Achainan, Beersheba khopi Judah gamsunga Negeb a chun anga uve.   
\p
\v 8 Hitia hi gamsung pumpi ahin khol sohkei phat uvin, lhako le ni somni alhin donin Jerusalem khopi ahung kile kit tauvin ahi.  
\v 9 Chuin Joab chun mihem jat asim nau mijat chu lengpa henga apelut tai. Hichea kisimdoh Israel mijat chu pasal galsat a chemjam choi thei cheh 800,000 alhingin, chule Judah mi chu 500,000 alhing uvin ahi.   
\s1 David Chonset Jeh A Thutanna  
\p
\v 10 Hiti chun mipi asim soh phat uvin, David chu athil hetkhenna in asugim behseh jengin ahi. Hijeh chun David injong Pakai henga taona aneijin hitin aseitai, “Ka thilbol chung changa hin keima melsa tah in ka chonse tai. Hijongleh tuhin Pakai, nahenga kahung tao ahi, nasohpa keima themmona jouse hi lamang tan; ajeh chu keiman ngol hoitah hin thil kana boltai,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Chuin ajing jingkah matah in David chu ajingtho a ahileh David dinga amitva neiya pangpa Gad themgaopa henga chun Pakaijin hitin thu ahin seiye.  
\v 12 “Chen lang David kom'a hitin gaseitan tin Pakaijin aseiye, “Keiman na chunga katoh ding thil thum kapeh ding, hiche thil thumho lah a chu nangman na ngap chat pen-pen khat chu kilhen in hichu na chunga kahin lhun sah ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hijeh chun Gad jong David kom'a ahungin hitin aseitai, “Na gamsunga kumthum sunga kellhah ding, lhathum sunga na galte masanga najam le-le diu, ahilouleh nithum sunga gamna hise nasatah lan ding nanop em? Tun eihin solpa henga ka seipeh ding chu hoiche pen ham geltoh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 “Kalung agim behseh jeng tai! Ami khotona lentah ahinai, hijeh chun Pakai khut a kilehlut jeng taute. Mihem khut a vang neilhah lutsah hih hel’in,” tin David in Gad chu adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hijeh chun Pakaijin Israel chate chunga chuche jingkah apat gamna hise ahin lansah pan tan, chule hichu nithum sungin alangin ahi. Hichea hin sahlam Dan khoa pat lhanglam Beersheba chan geiyin Israel mipi lah a mihem 70,000 athiuvin ahi.  
\v 16 Hichun vantil chun Jerusalem jong suhgam dinga agot a akhut alap phat chun Pakaijin thilse abol ding chu alung akhel’in vantil mi sugama pangpa kom'a chun hitin aseitai, “Aphaset tai! Tun nakhut umthim sah tan!” ati. Hiche pet a hi Pakai Vantil chu Jebus mipa Araunah changvohna mun changphol kom'a ana ding ahitai.   
\p
\v 17 Chuin David jong chun mi sugam a pang vantil chu amudoh phat in Pakai kom'a hitin aseiye, “Vetan, achonse a leh adihlou bol a chu keima kahi! Ahinla hiche miho hi kelngoi banga ima helou ahi bouve ipi abolset anei mongu ham? Na lunghanna chu keima chung le ka inkote chunga lhungjo tahen,” tin aseitai.   
\s1 David In Maicham Asem  
\p
\v 18 Hiche nikho hin Gad chu David henga ahungin akom'a hitin aseiye, “Chetouvin lang, Jebus mipa Araunah changphol kom'a khun Pakai dingin maicham khat gasem tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Pakaijin Gad thu apeh bangin David jong chu ache touvin agabol tan ahi.  
\v 20 Chuin Araunah chu akiheijin agahven ahileh lengpa le asohte ama kom lam jona ahungu chu amun ahi. Chuphat in Araunah jong chu apotdoh pai paiyin lengpa chu aga jabol’in tol'a amai asulut tan ahi.  
\v 21 Chujongleh Araunah chun hitin aseiye, “Ipi ding pen tah a kapu lengpa nangma nasoh kei kom'a nahung jeng hitam?” atileh;  
\p David chun adonbut in “Mipi chunga gamna hise hi akitol mang theina dinga nangma changphol hi chohdoh a hikom'a hi Pakai henga maicham khat semdoh ding kati ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Hichun Araunah jong chun hitin aseiye, “Kilah jengin kapu lengpa, chule nangin pha nasah lampi a chun mang jengin; chule bongchal teni jong pumgo thiltoa naman dingin hikom'a hin aum lhone; chujongleh chang huina kangkui ho leh bongchal teni namkol jong hikom'a hin aumnai; hiche ho hi meithinga nati ding ahi.  
\v 23 Vo lengpa, Keima Araunah kitipa hin lengpa dinga thil ijakai katodoh jeng ding ahi,” ati. Chujongleh Araunah chun lengpa kom'a hitin jong aseiye, “Pakai na Pathen'in na taona chu na sanpeh tei-tei hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 24 Ahivangin lengpan Araunah kom'a chun hitin aseiye, “Ahipoi, keiman na changphol man chu kapeh a kachoh ding ahi bouve; aman kapeh louhel thil chu keiman Pakai ka Pathen henga pumgo thiltoa kato louding ahi,” ati. Hiti hin David chun changphol leh bongchal teni chu dangka somnga in akichoh tai.   
\p
\v 25 Hichun lengpa David chun Pakai anga maicham khat asemin, pumgo thilto le chamna kilhaina thilto atoh tan ahi. Hichun Pakaijin jong gamsung dinga ataona chu asanpeh in Israel chate chunga kon'in gamna hise lang chu akitol mangsah tan ahi.   